terial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/141c4298-c99b-5014-9ad3-0e13f2d50c9f', 'word_count': 940, 'uri': 'nyt://article/141c4298-c99b-5014-9ad3-0e13f2d50c9f'}, {'abstract': 'Cam Levins was the star of the Armory Track Invitational in Manhattan, pulling off a stunning double win in the one-mile and two-mile races and beating the Olympic silver medalist Galen Rupp in completing the feat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/01/sports/canadian-upsets-olympic-medalist-in-winning-2-races-at-armory-track-invitational.html', 'snippet': 'Cam Levins was the star of the Armory Track Invitational in Manhattan, pulling off a stunning double win in the one-mile and two-mile races and beating the Olympic silver medalist Galen Rupp in completing the feat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like Samson, Cam Levins figures his hair is the source of his prowess.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Canadian Upsets Olympic Medalist in Winning 2 Races ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Canadian Upsets Olympic Medalist in Winning 2 Races', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Track and Field', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Casey, Patrick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-01T02:23:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Colin A. Stephenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Colin', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Stephenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8f13069-0315-5913-9b84-88fb4d6e083b', 'word_count': 722, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8f13069-0315-5913-9b84-88fb4d6e083b'}, {'abstract': 'Since he opened his first art foundry in the late 1960s, Dick Polich has helped produce sculptures for 500 artists, including Louise Bourgeois, Alexander Calder, Jasper Johns and Roy Lichtenstein.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/01/nyregion/at-polich-tallix-fine-art-foundry-master-of-metals-is-artists-ally.html', 'snippet': 'Since he opened his first art foundry in the late 1960s, Dick Polich has helped produce sculptures for 500 artists, including Louise Bourgeois, Alexander Calder, Jasper Johns and Roy Lichtenstein.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the late 1990s, the sculptor Rona Pondick arrived at Dick Polich’s foundry with some challenging goals. She was working on her now-famous animal-human hybrids and was interested in new ways of incorporating color in stainless steel. She recently recalled explaining her project to Mr. Polich: “He told me, ‘You’re trying to push the envelope, and I’ll go there with you.’ And then he said, ‘And while I’m going there with you, can I show you a few things I’m playing around with?’\xa0”', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01ARTSWE1/01ARTSWE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01ARTSWE1/01ARTSWE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01ARTSWE1/01ARTSWE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/nyregion/01ARTSWE1/01ARTSWE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1570, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None