ge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'January Job Data, Big Earnings Reports and the Greek Bailout', 'kicker': 'The Week Ahead', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'January Job Figures, and the Greek Bailout', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fiat Chrysler Automobiles N.V.', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BP Plc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Exxon Mobil Corporation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sony Pictures Entertainment', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton SA', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-01T22:15:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/febfd2ba-f149-53bd-b63b-659f198f9bee', 'word_count': 1183, 'uri': 'nyt://article/febfd2ba-f149-53bd-b63b-659f198f9bee'}, {'abstract': 'Ellsworth Kelly chose and installed every work in the exhibit “Monet/Kelly” at Clark Art Institute. The abstractionist and the impressionist unexpectedly make a logical match.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/02/arts/design/monet-kelly-at-clark-art-institute-ellsworth-kelly-falls-for-monet.html', 'snippet': 'Ellsworth Kelly chose and installed every work in the exhibit “Monet/Kelly” at Clark Art Institute. The abstractionist and the impressionist unexpectedly make a logical match.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WILLIAMSTOWN, Mass. — Love can be counterintuitive. If I were asked to pair up the artist Ellsworth Kelly with a historical soul mate, Claude Monet would not readily come to mind. The American painter of abstract pictures as clean as Shaker tables and the French Impressionist who piled on pigment as thick as mulch? I don’t think so. Yet here they are together in a small, crystalline show called “Monet/Kelly” at the Clark Art Institute, and they make an utterly logical, and mind-stretching, match.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/arts/02KELLYJP1/02KELLYJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/02/arts/02KELLYJP1/02KELLYJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 482}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/arts/02KELLYJP1/02KELLYJP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/arts/02KELLYJP1/02KELLYJP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1644, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/arts/02KELLYJP1/02KELLYJP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/02/arts/02KELLYJP1/02KELLYJP1-thu