ticle/d2b99e2c-0e5b-5ed8-9c5d-80e1a013f06a'}, {'abstract': 'With a late interception, New England’s Bill Belichick and Tom Brady won their fourth title, making them one of the most successful combinations of a coach and a quarterback.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/02/sports/football/patriots-win-super-bowl-xlix-defeating-seahawks.html', 'snippet': 'With a late interception, New England’s Bill Belichick and Tom Brady won their fourth title, making them one of the most successful combinations of a coach and a quarterback.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GLENDALE, Ariz. — The seconds ticked off late in the fourth quarter Sunday, and how familiar it must have all seemed to Bill Belichick, to Tom Brady, to the New England Patriots and their fans wondering why, oh why, was this happening again.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Yard From Crushing Loss, Patriots Grab Their 4th Title', 'kicker': 'Patriots 28, Seahawks 24', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Yard From Crushing Loss, Patriots Seize Their 4th Title', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Butler, Malcolm', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brady, Tom', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belichick, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Russell (1988- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lynch, Marshawn', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seattle Seahawks', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Butler, Malcolm (1990- )', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-02T03:07:03+0000', 'document_type': 'ar