ir second straight N.F.L. title, but the Patriots snatched it away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/02/sports/football/late-seahawks-drive-ends-with-a-screeching-halt-after-a-risky-call.html', 'snippet': 'In an improbable series of plays in the final 75 seconds of the Super Bowl, the Seahawks landed on the threshold of their second straight N.F.L. title, but the Patriots snatched it away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GLENDALE, Ariz. — On the same field where a receiver named David Tyree had improbably caught a desperation throw to propel the Giants to Super Bowl victory over the New England Patriots seven years earlier, the Seattle Seahawks had a potentially historic acrobatic catch of their own to remember and treasure.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/sports/02super-floater/02super-floater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 501, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/02/sports/02super-floater/02super-floater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 501}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/sports/02super-floater/02super-floater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 855, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/sports/02super-floater/02super-floater-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1528, 'width': 1831, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/sports/02super-floater/02super-floater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail