rations in Iraq, Syria and Afghanistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama is asking the new Republican Congress for a base defense budget of $534 billion in 2016, the Pentagon said on Monday in its annual budget release, exceeding by $35 billion the mandatory across-the-board reductions known as sequestration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/us/03PENTAGONweb/03PENTAGONweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/03/us/03PENTAGONweb/03PENTAGONweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/us/03PENTAGONweb/03PENTAGONweb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/us/03PENTAGONweb/03PENTAGONweb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1359, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/us/03PENTAGONweb/03PENTAGONweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/03/us/03PENTAGONweb/03PENTAGONweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/us/03PENTAGONweb/03PENTAGONweb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama’s Defense Budget Aims Higher, and at Overseas Conflicts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama’s Defense Budget Aims Higher, and at Overseas Conflicts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-02T16:32:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helene Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f33f570e-bdff-5ed8-83d0-529b123af7f2', 'word_count': 436, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f33f570e-bdff-5ed8-83d0-529b123af7f2'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: A duel leaves one injured in 1890.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/02/1890-blood-shed-for-honor/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: A duel leaves one injured in 1890.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The much talked-of duel between the Marquis de Morès and M. Camille Dreyfus was fought at 10.25 yesterday [Feb. 2] morning in the outskirts of the little town of Comines, which lies in Belgium, just beyond the French frontier. At the word of command, M. Dreyfus fired instantly, and missed. The Marquis de Morès aimed more deliberately, and sent his ball into the arm of his opponent just above the elbow joint. The wound is painful, but not serious. Had it not been for the fact that M. Dreyfus dropped his arm immediately on firing, it is very probable that he would have been mortally wounded. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Feb. 3, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/blogs/02iht-old1890/02iht-old1890-jumbo.png', 'height': 581, 'width': 337, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/blogs/02iht-old1890/02iht-old1890-superJumbo.png', 'height': 581, 'width': 337, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/02/blogs/02iht-old1890/02iht-old1890-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/02/blogs/02iht-old1890/02iht-old1890-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '1890: Blood Shed for Honor', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Duels and Dueling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belgium', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-02T16:35:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8e58636-a01a-51e4-92af-23f5e4e73e00', 'word_count': 116, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8e58636-a01a-51e4-92af-23f5e4e73e00'}, {'abstract': 'Generations of the Casuso family have endured urban blight and change as they continue to call Bushwick their home