93dd-bd487cc2fb23', 'word_count': 850, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14bd6c93-299a-5183-93dd-bd487cc2fb23'}, {'abstract': 'The elegant Birkin bag gets a practical upgrade for the 21st century.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/02/hermes-birkin-sellier-40/', 'snippet': 'The elegant Birkin bag gets a practical upgrade for the 21st century.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s tough to improve on perfection, but that’s precisely what Hermès has done with the new hyper-pared-down Birkin Sellier 40. According to Couli Jobert, the leather artistic director at Hermès, natural brown was deemed too obvious for the new Birkin, which is only available in matte black with silver palladium hardware. As the goal was to create an essential design without clutter, the structured cowhide bag is extra-wide, has no lining and the stitching is extremely subtle. It’s a radically modern update of the elegant classic, which has been the subject of girl envy — and the cause of waiting lists — since it was first crafted in 1984.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '108', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-look-birkin/15womens-look-birkin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-look-birkin/15womens-look-birkin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-look-birkin/15womens-look-birkin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-look-birkin/15womens-look-birkin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 6