verseeing the settlement between the N.F.L. and the 5,000 former players who accused the league of hiding the dangers of concussions from them has asked both sides to revise parts of their deal before she would give her final approval.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Asks for Revisions to Concussion Settlement', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Judge Calls for Sides to Revise Settlement', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concussions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brody, Anita B', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-03T01:37:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Belson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dbfe1919-6c07-553b-8cb5-b765aed1c92c', 'word_count': 503, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dbfe1919-6c07-553b-8cb5-b765aed1c92c'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama’s budget calls for a lower overall tax rate, but also for a one-time 14 percent tax on all cash sitting overseas.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/02/02/tax-reform-is-the-cry-until-details-are-offered/', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s budget calls for a lower overall tax rate, but also for a one-time 14 percent tax on all cash sitting overseas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been a regular refrain from corporate America’s chief executives, “Corporate tax in this country needs to be reformed,” Jeffrey R. Immelt, the chief executive of General Electric, has said repeatedly. Timothy D. Cook, Apple’s chief executive, told lawmakers, “Apple has recommended to the Obama administration and several members of Congress — and suggests to the subcommittee today — to pass legislation that dramatically simplifies the U.S. corporate tax system.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/business/sorkin/sorkin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/03/business/sorkin/sorkin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/business/sorkin/sorkin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/business/sorkin/sorkin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1402, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/business/sorkin/sorkin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/03/business/sorkin/sorkin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/business/sorkin/sorkin-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tax Reform Is the Cry, Until Details Are Offered', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tax Reform Is the Cry, U