 '_id': 'nyt://interactive/d6b2e607-29ef-5776-96cc-d472db516f9a', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/d6b2e607-29ef-5776-96cc-d472db516f9a'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Tuesday, February 3, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/03/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-tuesday-february-3-2015.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Tuesday, February 3, 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I watched him walk one block away. I turned around to go back upstairs, and that was the last time I saw him.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Tuesday, February 3, 2015', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-03T04:03:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/522ceccf-7524-57d6-88f0-ee30fddfc821', 'word_count': 51, 'uri': 'nyt://article/522ceccf-7524-57d6-88f0-ee30fddfc821'}, {'abstract': 'A new report from the Institute for Safe Medication Practices found only about half of reports of serious side effects submitted by manufacturers met basic standards for completeness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/03/business/drug-makers-data-on-side-effects-is-called-lacking-in-a-report.html', 'snippet': 'A new report from the Institute for Safe Medication Practices found only about half of reports of serious side effects submitted by manufacturers met basic standards for completeness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The main system for keeping track of the dangerous side effects of prescription drugs is deeply flawed, primarily because drug makers are submitting incomplete information about the problems to the Food and Drug Administration, according to a new study by a nonprofit group that tracks drug safety issues.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drug Makers’ Data on Side Effects Is Called Lacking in a Report ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drug Makers’ Data on Side Effects Is Called Lacking in a Report', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Katie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Data-Mining and Database Marketing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Institute for Safe Medication Practices', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-03T04:09:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Thomas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thomas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/973d7eca-ae7c-58f4-a37b-11d08f84fe22', 'word_count': 882, 'uri': 'nyt://article/973d7eca-ae7c-58f4-a37b-11d08f84fe22'}, {'abstract': 'New England’s 28-24 victory Sunday attracted a record 114.4 million viewers, more than the average of 112.2 million who tuned in live to Seattle’s 43-8 rout of Denver last year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/03/sports/football/super-bowl-was-a-stunner-and-thats-just-the-size-of-the-tv-audience.html', 'snippet': 'New England’s 28-24 victory Sunday attracted a record 114.4 million viewers, more than the average of 112.2 million who tuned in live to Seattle’s 43-8 rout of Denver last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The other day I suggested that even a lousy game can yield sensational Super Bowl viewership, which happened last year. But a game that is incredible, surprising, tightly played and has everything but an elf on the sideline deflating balls?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Super Bowl Was a Stunner, and That’s Just the Size of the TV Audience ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Super Bowl Was a Stunner, and That’s Just the Size of the TV Audience', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seattle Seahawks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Katy', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collinsworth, Cris', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-03T04:13:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44c166d8-7997-58e8-8471-61cca39f8c0f', 'word_count': 709, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44c166d8-7997-58e8-8471-61cca39f8c0f'}, {'abstract': 'For those in town for this year’s Zona Maco International Contemporary Art Fair, a new food hall offers up a range of local flavors — and an internationally-sourced biergarten.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/03/t-magazine/zona-maco-art-fair-mercado-roma-mexico-city.html', 'snippet': 'For those in town for this year’s Zona Maco International Contemporary Art Fair, a new food hall offers up a range of local flavors — and an internationally-sourced biergarten.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tomorrow, more than 120 galleries from 22 countries will descend upon Mexico City for the 12th edition of the Zona Maco International Contemporary Art Fair. And this year, the art set has a new culinary destination to hit up between booth visits: Mercado Roma. Situated in the hipster neighborhood of La Roma, the bustling food market, which opened last summer, takes its cues from sleek stateside food halls like Manhattan’s Chelsea Market. There are communal tables set against a vertical garden out back, where guests can enjoy prepared foods and artisanal treats from approximately 60 vendors, most of whom produce local, farm-to-table dishes and desserts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03mexico-navarro/03mexico-navarro-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03mexico-navarro/03mexico-navarro-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03mexico-navarro/03mexico-navarro-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03mexico-navarro/03mexico-navarro-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03mexico-navarro/03mexico-navarro-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03mexico-navarro/03mexico-navarro-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03mexico-navarro/03mexico-navarro-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside Mercado Roma, Mexico City’s Newest Foodie Destination', 'kicker': 'Food Matters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-03T05:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TLiving', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chadner Navarro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chadner', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Navarro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d1af28c-29ff-5f78-a143-d10f7bdded32', 'word_count': 454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d1af28c-29ff-5f78-a143-d10f7bdded32'}, {'abstract': 'GNC, Target, Walgreens and Walmart were accused of selling fraudulent and potentially dangerous herbal supplements and told by New York State officials to stop selling them.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/03/new-york-attorney-general-targets-supplements-at-major-retailers/', 'snippet': 'GNC, Target, Walgreens and Walmart were accused of selling fraudulent and potentially dangerous herbal supplements and told by New York State officials to stop selling them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York State attorney general’s office accused four major retailers on Monday of selling fraudulent and potentially dangerous herb