ince then, she’s been consulting for various brands (including Mulberry and Balmain) and, last year, launched her own line of footwear, initially intended for men. She deems Solovière — named after her maternal grandfather — “a laboratory for new classics.” And her latest experiment came at the request of the Parisian boutique Colette: to offer additional sizes, effectively making some of her designs unisex.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03soloviere-moroz/03soloviere-moroz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03soloviere-moroz/03soloviere-moroz-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03soloviere-moroz/03soloviere-moroz-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03soloviere-moroz/03soloviere-moroz-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03soloviere-moroz/03soloviere-moroz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03soloviere-moroz/03soloviere-moroz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/t-magazine/03soloviere-moroz/03soloviere-moroz-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150