, the ‘‘gang des châteaux’’ carefully selected only a few of many valuable items readily available for the taking. The style of the operation has been so consistent that police investigating the latest theft reportedly are working on the theory that the burglars are ‘‘replying to the orders’’ of a private collector. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Feb. 4, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/blogs/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux-jumbo.png', 'height': 629, 'width': 542, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/blogs/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux-superJumbo.png', 'height': 629, 'width': 542, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/blogs/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/04/blogs/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/blogs/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux/04iht-oldfeb04-chateaux-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Connoisseurs Steal Paintings', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 2, '