crowded train in Westchester County in New York slammed into a sport-utility vehicle at a crossing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/04/nyregion/metro-north-train-hits-vehicle-on-tracks.html', 'snippet': 'A crowded train in Westchester County in New York slammed into a sport-utility vehicle at a crossing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A crowded Metro-North Railroad train passing through Westchester County at the height of the evening rush on Tuesday slammed into a sport-utility vehicle on the tracks at a crossing, creating a fiery crash and explosion that killed seven people, injured a dozen and forced the evacuation of hundreds. It was the deadliest crash in the railroad’s history.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/nyregion/04TRAINsub/04TRAINsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/04/nyregion/04TRAINsub/04TRAINsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/nyregion/04TRAINsub/04TRAINsub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/nyregion/04TRAINsub/04TRAINsub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1534, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/nyregion/04TRAINsub/04TRAINsub-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/04/nyregion/04TRAINsub/04TRAINsub-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 't