set a world record and to draw visitors to Superior, Wis., collapsed on Tuesday, three months after a backyard sculptor began the $30,000 project.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/04/us/a-crashing-end-to-a-work-of-ice-a-city-had-warmed-up-to.html', 'snippet': 'A 66-foot ice tower built to set a world record and to draw visitors to Superior, Wis., collapsed on Tuesday, three months after a backyard sculptor began the $30,000 project.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SUPERIOR, Wis. — The ingredients needed to build the world’s tallest ice sculpture — bountiful water and extremely cold weather — exist in abundance in this small city hard on the state’s northwesternmost tip. A perfect place, in other words, for a self-taught engineer named Roger Hanson to surpass that record. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/04WALL2-hp/04WALL2-hp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 133, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/04/us/04WALL2-hp/04WALL2-hp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 133}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/04WALL2-hp/04WALL2-hp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 226, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/04WALL2-hp/04WALL2-hp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 453, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/04WALL2-hp/04WALL2-hp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/04/