ver six months, following an ATR-72 crash on July 23 that killed 48 people. The cause of that crash is still under investigation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taiwan: Plane Crashes in Taipei', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taiwan: Plane Crashes in Taipei', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taiwan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents, Safety and Disasters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TransAsia Airways', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taipei (Taiwan)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-04T05:11:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Austin Ramzy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Austin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramzy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/71c761a5-20ea-55d6-9b07-4949b9403be6', 'word_count': 131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71c761a5-20ea-55d6-9b07-4949b9403be6'}, {'abstract': 'A passenger plane with 53 passengers and five crew members aboard crashed into a river in Taiwan’s capital, Taipei, shortly after takeoff on Wednesday morning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/05/world/asia/small-passenger-plane-crashes-into-river-in-taiwan.html', 'snippet': 'A passenger plane with 53 passengers and five crew members aboard crashed into a river in Taiwan’s capital, Taipei, shortly after takeoff on Wednesday morning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — A passenger plane crashed into a river in Taiwan’s capital, Taipei, shortly after takeoff on Wednesday mo