’', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Europe’s Expanding ‘Right to Be Forgotten’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Censorship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Court of Justice', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privacy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search Engines', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-04T08:27:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/49ff9932-0344-545c-9421-8c27ea502364', 'word_count': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49ff9932-0344-545c-9421-8c27ea502364'}, {'abstract': 'What’s behind the coming address to Congress by Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/04/opinion/thomas-friedman-a-bad-mistake.html', 'snippet': 'What’s behind the coming address to Congress by Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The decision by Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu and House Speaker John Boehner to cook up an address to Congress by Netanyahu on why the U.S. should get tougher on Iran is churlish, reckless and, for the future of Israeli-American relations, quite dangerous. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ