ight change in the precariously controlled violence of the sun, an enormous thermonuclear furnace, can have drastic consequences on Earth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/05/science/living-with-a-star.html', 'snippet': 'Even a slight change in the precariously controlled violence of the sun, an enormous thermonuclear furnace, can have drastic consequences on Earth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a fact rarely appreciated by the general public that to professional astronomers, the Sun is a pretty boring star. Which in fact is great news for the rest of us.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Living With a Star', 'kicker': 'Out There', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space and Astronomy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sun', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-04T16:36:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Overbye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Overbye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/64c65ced-1e2d-58e9-9ef4-a0605038b4b7', 'word_count': 577, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64c65ced-1e2d-58e9-9ef4-a0605038b4b7'}, {'abstract': 'Though it is sedate in comparison with other stars, our sun is a volatile neighbor, a thermonuclear furnace fueling spectacular storms that send high-energy particles and radiation far out into space.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/science/100000003489464/out-there-raining-fire.html', 'snippet': 'Though it is sedate in comparison with other stars, our sun is a volatile neighbor, a thermonuclear furnace fueling spectacular storms that send high-energy pa