, 'word_count': 240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab2e16ee-ec34-56f7-b3d6-c864dfb1f32f'}, {'abstract': 'The Patriots of Bill Belichick and Tom Brady always seem able to dig themselves out, but it will take a lot of work for the Seahawks to overcome such a devastating loss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/05/sports/football/patriots-get-a-parade-the-seahawks-a-long-winter.html', 'snippet': 'The Patriots of Bill Belichick and Tom Brady always seem able to dig themselves out, but it will take a lot of work for the Seahawks to overcome such a devastating loss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thousands of fans ignored freezing temperatures Wednesday in Boston and turned out to honor their beloved New England Patriots with a championship parade. Despite two recent storms, which have buried the city under three feet of snow, the Patriots’ faithful lined a route from the Prudential Center to City Hall Plaza and cheered as amphibious trucks carrying players and coaches passed by.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/05/sports/Y-RHODEN/Y-RHODEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/05/sports/Y-RHODEN/Y-RHODEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/05/sports/Y-RHODEN/Y-RHODEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/05/sports/Y-RHODEN/Y-RHODEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image