3a25-bf0a-593a-942c-f5ac70563fa7'}, {'abstract': 'Downhill racers’ lone companion is noise, and in their merciless and nervy world, sometimes the louder things are the better.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/sports/the-unmistakable-sound-of-speed-on-the-slopes.html', 'snippet': 'Downhill racers’ lone companion is noise, and in their merciless and nervy world, sometimes the louder things are the better.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEAVER CREEK, Colo. — In an Alpine downhill race, there is no more lonely and solitary position than standing over a pair of skis hurtling down the mountain at 80 miles an hour.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Delicate Dance With Gravity, Downhill Racers Are Soothed by Cacophony ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Delicate Dance With Gravity, Downhill Racers Are Soothed by Cacophony', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skiing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Noise', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALPINE SKIING', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jansrud, Kjetil', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nyman, Steven', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-05T15:05:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/28076ece-035e-542f-aa49-d07738af793a', 'word_count': 1157, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28076ece-035e-542f-aa49-d07738af793a'}, {'abstract': 'Policy battles between the president and Senator Robert Menendez of New Jersey, the top Democrat on the Foreign Relations Committee, have burst into public view.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/us/politics/senator-robert-menendez-obama-cuba-iran.html', 'snippet': 'Policy battles between the president and Senator Robert Menendez of New Jersey, the top Democrat on the Foreign Relations Committee, have burst into public view.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — When Senator Robert Menendez of New Jersey said last week that he would give President Obama two months before defying a veto threat and voting for new sanctions on Iran, he made it clear that the delay was not out of loyalty to his fellow Democrat in the Oval Office.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/05MENENDEZWEB/05MENENDEZWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/04/us/05MENENDEZWEB/05MENENDEZWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/05MENENDEZWEB/05MENENDEZWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/05MENENDEZWEB/05MENENDEZWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/05MENENDEZWEB/05MENENDEZWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/04/us/05MENENDEZWEB/05MENENDEZWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 