 'uri': 'nyt://video/511ace4c-8816-568b-941d-466b43505c63'}, {'abstract': 'The “Broad City” star shares a few things he loves, from a beat machine to B.A.D. Burger.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/05/hannibal-buress-favorite-comedians-inspiration-interview/', 'snippet': 'The “Broad City” star shares a few things he loves, from a beat machine to B.A.D. Burger.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For an “underground” comedian, Hannibal Buress is fairly omnipresent these days. On television, he is a co-star on both “Broad City” and “The Eric Andre Show.” On stage, he is currently touring the country and will appear at the Brooklyn Academy of Music on Sunday, Feb 8. And lately in the media, he has gained (somewhat reluctant) recognition for bringing the allegations against Bill Cosby into the public dialogue.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/t-magazine/04buress-miller-slide-4OJ9/04buress-miller-slide-4OJ9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/04/t-magazine/04buress-miller-slide-4OJ9/04buress-miller-slide-4OJ9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/t-magazine/04buress-miller-slide-4OJ9/04buress-miller-slide-4OJ9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/t-magazine/04buress-miller-slide-4OJ9/04buress-miller-slide-4OJ9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/t-magaz