light from the International Herald Tribune archives: The Supreme War Council discusses the military and political aspects of the war in 1940.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/05/1940-war-council-meeting-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'Highlight from the International Herald Tribune archives: The Supreme War Council discusses the military and political aspects of the war in 1940.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fifth and most important Allied Supreme War Council met yesterday at the War Ministry in Paris to study the military and political aspects of the war, as well as to survey the European situation generally in view of possible early developments with the end of the winter. The question of supplies was given special emphasis, and the communiqué issued at the end of the day’s meetings stated that there was complete agreement on all questions taken up. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Feb. 6, 1940', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/05/blogs/05iht-old06-1940/05iht-old06-1940-articleLarge.png', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/05/blogs/05iht-old06-1940/05iht-old06-1940-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/05/blogs/05iht-old06-1940/05iht-old06-1940-jumbo.png', 'height': 732, 'width': 979, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/05/blogs/05iht-old06-1940/05iht-old06-1940-superJumbo.png', 'height': 732, 'width': 979, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/0