ow they talk and what they talk about, the grainy texture of the images and the weariness of the world they capture — all of these emerge from a time capsule devoted to an era that doesn’t quite have a name. But partly because those images have remained unseen for so long, and partly because Ms. Collins, who died in 1988, was such a bold and idiosyncratic filmmaker, “Losing Ground” also feels like news, like a bulletin from a vital and as-yet-unexplored dimension of reality.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Peeling Back the Layers of Black Indie Film', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Peeling Back the Layers of Black Indie Film', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Film Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collins, Kathleen (1942-88)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Losing Ground (Movie)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gunn, Bill (1934-89)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Ganja and Hess (Movie)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greaves, William (1926-2014)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Symbiopsychotaxiplasm: Take One (Movie)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Spike', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Billops, Camille (1933- )', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hatch, James V', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 