/article/56904a2a-5c85-5a52-8d1d-16a356956782'}, {'abstract': 'Brian Williams’s tale-telling about being aboard a chopper that took fire in Iraq could shake his career as NBC News anchor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/arts/television/brian-williamss-war-story.html', 'snippet': 'Brian Williams’s tale-telling about being aboard a chopper that took fire in Iraq could shake his career as NBC News anchor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a “thing that you build slowly, over time,” according to grandiloquent promos last fall that extolled Brian Williams’s 10th anniversary as anchor of “NBC Nightly News.” Over shots of Mr. Williams talking to soldiers and small children in war zones and disaster areas, the narrator, Michael Douglas, adds, “And what you build, if you work hard enough, if you respect it, is a powerful thing called trust.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/brian-williams-watching/brian-williams-watching-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 795, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/04/us/brian-williams-watching/brian-williams-watching-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 795}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/brian-williams-watching/brian-williams-watching-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 773, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/04/us/brian-williams-watching/brian-williams-watching-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1509, 'width': 1139, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i