6-1395842ff382', 'word_count': 257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b39f4e58-f766-56ca-9ad6-1395842ff382'}, {'abstract': '“The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water” sends SpongeBob and his whole world into post-apocalyptic chaos.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/movies/in-new-spongebob-movie-bikini-bottom-goes-mad-max.html', 'snippet': '“The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water” sends SpongeBob and his whole world into post-apocalyptic chaos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Explaining the appeal of SpongeBob SquarePants is a fool’s errand, but then that’s also a pretty good description of the adventures had by this irrepressible, highly absorbent hero. “The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water” is the show’s second feature-length installment, and while less fluid and fresh than its 2004 predecessor, the new film displays enough nutty writing and sheer brio to confirm the stamina of its enduring and skillfully voiced characters.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/arts/06SPONGEBOB/SPONGEBOB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/06/arts/06SPONGEBOB/SPONGEBOB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/arts/06SPONGEBOB/SPONGEBOB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/arts/06SPONGEBOB/SPONGEBOB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1998, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/arts/06S