ns of colleges, including Harvard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/education/new-harvard-policy-bans-teacher-student-relations.html', 'snippet': 'The move comes as the Obama administration investigates the handling of accusations of sexual assault at dozens of colleges, including Harvard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Harvard University has adopted a ban on professors’ having sexual or romantic relationships with undergraduate students, joining a small but growing number of universities prohibiting such relationships. The move comes as the Obama administration investigates the handling of accusations of sexual assault at dozens of colleges, including Harvard.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Harvard Policy Bans Teacher-Student Relations ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Harvard Policy Bans Teacher-Student Relations', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Harvard University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-06T02:07:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall and Tamar Lewin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Southall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Tamar', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lewin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00de2c18-5c9c-513e-ab46-9a17f04f2484', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00de2c18-5c9c-513e-ab46-9a17f04f2484'}, {'abstract': 'The insurer failed to protect data in its computers through encryption in the same way it protected medical information, and 80 million records were accessed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/business/experts-suspect-lax-security-left-anthem-vulnerable-to-hackers.html', 'snippet': 'The insurer failed to protect data in its computers through encryption in the same way it protected medical information, and 80 million records were accessed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cyberattack on Anthem, one of the nation’s largest health insurers, points to the vulnerability of health care companies, which security specialists say are behind other industries in protecting sensitive personal information.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/business/anthem1/anthem1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 497, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/06/business/anthem1/anthem1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 497}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/business/anthem1/anthem1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 849, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/business/anthem1/anthem1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1697, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/business/anthem1/anthem1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/06/business/anthem1/anthem1-thumbStandard.jpg', '