rse race to make nice with the next generation of maybe-possible fashion stars (and win their loyalty and affection for a maybe-possible future) — Chanel is putting ever-more assets into the game. Its latest vehicle: the Andam award, the second-largest grant to a young designer, albeit one willing to be based and working in France.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chanel Raises the Stakes in the Young Designers Game', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Contests and Prizes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coca, Johnny', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lagerfeld, Karl', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Michele, Alessandro', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pinault, Francois-Henri', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chanel SA', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Galeries Lafayette SA', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gucci', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kering SA', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton SA', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mulberry Co Ltd', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-06T14:16:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dcfd3813-2d03-58ad-b55f-3d6f83df20b1', 'word_count': 546, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dcfd3813-2d03-58ad-b55f-3d6f83df20b1'}, {'abstract': 'The documentarian Stanley Nelson discusses his new film, “The Black Panthers: Vanguard of the Revolution.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/08/movies/stanley-nelson-and-the-black-panthers-vanguard-of-the-revolution.html', 'snippet': 'The documentarian Stanley Nelson discusses his new film, “The Black Panthers: Vanguard of the Revolution.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stanley Nelson has to admit that his timing was good. His new documentary, “The Black Panthers: Vanguard of the Revolution,” is starting to play at festivals — it had its premiere at Sundance last month — in the wake of the nationwide protests over police killings of African-American men in Ferguson, Mo., and Staten Island. The moment is right for a documentary history of the Panthers, with its images of armed black men patrolling the streets and walking onto the floor of the California Legislature.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/arts/08FORTNIGHT1/08FORTNIGHT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/08/arts/08FORTNIGHT1/08FORTNIGHT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/arts/08FORTNIGHT1/08FORTNIGHT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJum