and all were hideously burned or otherwise injured about the face, rendering identification difficult or impossible. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Feb. 7, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1890: A Catastrophe in the Pits', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Explosions (Accidental)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wales', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-06T15:39:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3aceb519-958c-5ab9-b7bf-5413315befe7', 'word_count': 154, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3aceb519-958c-5ab9-b7bf-5413315befe7'}, {'abstract': 'Melissa Clark makes this rich dessert with bittersweet chocolate, heavy cream and brown sugar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/dining/100000003490833/dark-chocolate-pudding.html', 'snippet': 'Melissa Clark makes this rich dessert with bittersweet chocolate, heavy cream and brown sugar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Melissa Clark makes this rich dessert with bittersweet chocolate, heavy cream and brown sugar.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/03/multimedia/clark-choc-pudding/clark-choc-pudding-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337