 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b33eea1f-155b-5a49-b5ba-8d69835f7a7b', 'word_count': 1040, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b33eea1f-155b-5a49-b5ba-8d69835f7a7b'}, {'abstract': 'The actress explains why she has always been quick to move on from the roles Hollywood expects of her.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/carpetbagger-video-patricia-arquette-on-leaving-the-ingenue-behind/', 'snippet': 'The actress explains why she has always been quick to move on from the roles Hollywood expects of her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Patricia Arquette has been among the consistent front-runners this awards season for her performance as the mother in “Boyhood,” the coming-of-age tale filmed over 12 years. In part, she has been celebrated for agreeing to age on camera. But as the Oscar-nominated Ms. Arquette tells the Bagger, she has long been leery of following the rules Hollywood dictates for actresses’ careers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Carpetbagger Video: Patricia Arquette on Leaving the Ingenue Behind', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARQUETTE, PATRICIA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-06T17:02:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c59d25d2-2b55-545d-9bd2-3fc26c2b0db0', 'word_count': 62, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c59d25d2-2b55-545d-9bd2-3fc26c2b0db0'}, {'abstract': 'By the time they reach adulthood, their risk of asthma is no greater than that of full-term babies, a Danish study has found.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/premature-babies-with-asthma-outgrow-it/', 'snippet': 'By the time they reach adulthood, their risk of asthma is no greater than that of full-term babies, a Danish study has found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Parents of premature babies worry about many things, including an increased risk of asthma. But a large Danish study has found that asthma, common in premature babies, disappears as the children grow older. By the time they are adults, their risk of asthma is no greater than that of babies born full term.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/29/health/well_childbirth/well_childbirth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 214, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/29/health/well_childbirth/well_childbirth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 214, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/29/health/well_childbirth/well_childbirth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/05/29/health/well_childbirth/well_childbirth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/29/health/well_childbirth/well_childbirth-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Premature Babies With Asthma Outgrow It', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Childbirth: Preemies Outgrow Asthma', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asthma', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Premature Babies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Damgaard, Anne Louise', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-06T17:10:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4824e798-1816-5e7b-86f1-49ade1a598b5', 'word_count': 217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4824e798-1816-5e7b-86f1-49ade1a598b5'}, {'abstract': 'The bufflehead (Bucephala albeola) is a tiny, tough little duck, with a tight, stocky body that is well proportioned and beautifully suited to a life diving for food along the frigid shoreline of the Atlantic.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/06/bufflehead-ducks-bob-along-atlantic-shoreline/', 'snippet': 'The bufflehead (Bucephala albeola) is a tiny, tough little duck, with a tight, stocky body that is well proportioned and beautifully suited to a life diving for food along the frigid shoreline of the Atlantic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cure for winter blues is often trudging right in, so with only the slightest north wind and the light babble and hiss of clear green wavelets for company, I started a short walk along the Rockaway Inlet on a recent break in the snow. A cool fog, which sometimes follows a warm winter day, reduced anything beyond my immediate surroundings to haze. I had to stop at one point to admire this trick of the Atlantic — making a thousand-mile horizon vanish — and as I did, five buffleheads appeared as if fashioned just that moment on the limpid seawater. They bobbed like corks, sharply defined in black and white, and I resisted the urge to make them agents with greater intentions. Finally, unable to resolve their vague message, I spent my time figuring out the birds instead.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/nyregion/08NATURE/08NATURE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/08/nyregion/08NATURE/08NATURE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/nyregion/08NATURE/08NATURE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 550, 'width': 824, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/nyregion/08NATURE/08NATURE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 550, 'width': 824, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/nyregion/08NATURE/08NATURE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/08/nyregion/08NATURE/08NATURE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/nyregion/08NATURE/08NATURE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bufflehead Ducks Bob Along the Atlantic Shoreline', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Head of a Buffalo, Wings Like a Bee', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ducks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-06T17:16:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Taft', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taft', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/adf9e5c0-3d00-52ad-8f13-cd43c5f7a26e', 'word_count': 508, 'uri': 'nyt://article/adf9e5c0-3d00-52ad-8f13-cd43c5f7a26e'}, {'abstract': 'The Palestinian-American poet reads his meditation on love and longing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2015/02/06/t-magazine/0206picturepoem.html', 'snippet': 'The Palestinian-American poet reads his meditation on love and longing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Palestinian-American poet reads his meditation on love and longing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Reading of “Almost Your Life” by Fady Joudah', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-06T17:17:14+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/41336bf9-8e27-53d5-b176-b0c4c9190f77', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/41336bf9-8e27-53d5-b176-b0c4c9190f77'}, {'abstract': 'Low-income and minority households have gained no ground in homeownership over the last few years, and are actually doing worse in many states.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/08/realestate/low-income-and-minority-households-far-behind-in-homeownership.html', 'snippet': 'Low-income and minority households have gained no ground in homeownership over the last few years, and are actually doing worse in many states.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The rising tide of economic recovery is not lifting those most in need, according to an annual scorecard of financial security and opportunity put out by the nonprofit Corporation for Enterprise Development. Low- to moderate-income households and households of color remain far behind on a number of measures of financial well-being, especially when it comes to homeownership.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/realestate/08mort/08mort-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 301, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/08/realestate/08mort/08mort-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 301}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/realestate/08mort/08mort-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 514, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/realestate/08mort/08mort-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1426, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/realestate/08mort/08mort-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/08/realestate/08mort/08mort-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/realestate/08mort/08mort-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gap Persists in Homeownership', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gap Persists in Homeownership', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prevost, Lisa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-06T17:18:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Prevost', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Prevost', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9bc6689e-d231-5eb3-b476-5260227bcffc', 'word_count': 551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9bc6689e-d231-5eb3-b476-5260227bcffc'}, {'abstract': 'A sparkling mosaic mural, depicting the life of America’s first saint, Frances Xavier Cabrini, patron saint of immigrants, was recently restored to its original luster.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/08/nyregion/in-upper-manhattan-restoring-the-golden-halo-of-mother-cabrini.html', 'snippet': 'A sparkling mosaic mural, depicting the life of America’s first saint, Frances Xavier Cabrini, patron saint of immigrants, was recently restored to its original luster.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the apse of a midcentury chapel in Upper Manhattan, there is a sparkling mosaic mural that depicts the life of America’s first saint, Frances Xavier Cabrini. The mural was recently restored to its original luster using period tiles, or tesserae, made of various types of marble (Carrara, Botticino) as well as gilded Venetian glass tiles, made by fusing 22-karat gold leaf between layers of glass and crystal.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The N