a83bd79fc7'}, {'abstract': 'Taurasi’s decision to sit out the 2015 W.N.B.A. season for more pay from her Russian team says much about the state of the pro women’s game in the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/07/sports/basketball/diana-taurasi-can-rest-easy-but-wnba-cant.html', 'snippet': 'Taurasi’s decision to sit out the 2015 W.N.B.A. season for more pay from her Russian team says much about the state of the pro women’s game in the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Diana Taurasi announced recently that she would not play in the W.N.B.A. in 2015, she did not have to explain herself to Sue Bird. After all these years, rest for rubles, Bird knew what Taurasi had earned.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/07ARATONweb1/07ARATONweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/07ARATONweb1/07ARATONweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/07ARATONweb1/07ARATONweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/07ARATONweb1/07ARATONweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/07ARATONweb1/07ARATONweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/07ARATONweb1/07ARATONweb1-