d', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/1315ce73-ce1c-55b9-9e66-ccbaae26cd02', 'word_count': 627, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1315ce73-ce1c-55b9-9e66-ccbaae26cd02'}, {'abstract': 'A decade after her well-publicized exit from News Corporation, Judith Regan has a new publishing imprint backed by Leon Black, and is making deals and taking on enemies — both old (Rupert Murdoch) and new (Amazon).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/08/fashion/judith-regan-is-back-watch-out.html', 'snippet': 'A decade after her well-publicized exit from News Corporation, Judith Regan has a new publishing imprint backed by Leon Black, and is making deals and taking on enemies — both old (Rupert Murdoch) and new (Amazon).', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Judith Regan’s corner office on the eighth floor of an office building on Bleecker Street is a picture frame with a quote inside it that reads, “Against the ruin of the world, there is only one defense: The creative act.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/fashion/08jpREGAN/08jpREGAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/08/fashion/08jpREGAN/08jpREGAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/fashion/08jpREGAN/08jpREGAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/fashion/08jpREGAN/08jpREGAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':