to the Fire,” based on the life of the French sculptor, at Zankel Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/07/arts/music/joyce-didonato-celebrates-camille-claudel-at-zankel-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The mezzo-soprano Joyce DiDonato offered the premiere of Jake Heggie’s “Camille Claudel: Into the Fire,” based on the life of the French sculptor, at Zankel Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The life of the French sculptor Camille Claudel is a tangle of art, passion, madness and betrayal. A student and lover of Rodin’s, Claudel was a critically acclaimed artist when she began to show signs of mental distress, which led her family to commit her to an institution, where she spent the remaining 30 years of her life.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/arts/subBreantanp/subBreantanp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/07/arts/subBreantanp/subBreantanp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/arts/subBreantanp/subBreantanp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/arts/subBreantanp/subBreantanp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1340, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/arts/subBreantanp/subBreantanp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/07/arts/subBreantanp/subBreantanp-thum