292b85-d3e8-5958-9efb-907711308ea8'}, {'abstract': 'An interactive chart of words taken from millions of student reviews of their instructors offers a vivid illustration of unconscious gender bias.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/07/upshot/is-the-professor-bossy-or-brilliant-much-depends-on-gender.html', 'snippet': 'An interactive chart of words taken from millions of student reviews of their instructors offers a vivid illustration of unconscious gender bias.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Male professors are brilliant, awesome and knowledgeable. Women are bossy and annoying, and beautiful or ugly.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Is the Professor Bossy or Brilliant? Much Depends on Gender', 'kicker': 'In a Word', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmidt, Benjamin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-07T01:16:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Cain Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': 'Cain', 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60d1f539-f4fb-5213-9034-68d135b84f40', 'word_count': 584, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60d1f539-f4fb-5213-9034-68d135b84f40'}, {'abstract': 'The unemployment rate edged higher to 5.7% from 5.6%, but the U.S. economy added a better-than-expected 257,000 jobs in January, according to the latest data from the Bureau of Labor Statistics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2015/02/06/business/jobs-0207.html', 'snippet': 'The unemployment rate edged higher to 5.7% from 5.6%, but the U.S. economy added a better-than-expected 257,000 jobs in January, according to the latest data from the Bureau of Labor Statistics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The unemployment rate edged higher to 5.7% from 5.6%, but the U.S. economy added a better-than-expected 257,000 jobs in January, according to the latest data from the Bureau of Labor Statistics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/business/jobs-0207-1423270421173/jobs-0207-1423270421173-articleLarge.png', 'height': 495, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/06/business/jobs-0207-1423270421173/jobs-0207-1423270421173-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 495}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/business/jobs-0207-1423270421173/jobs-0207-1423270421173-jumbo.png', 'height': 845, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/business/jobs-0207-1423270421173/jobs-0207-1423270421173-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1690, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/business/jobs-0207-1423270421173/jobs-0207-1423270421173-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/06/business/jobs-0207-1423270421173/jobs-0207-1423270421173-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/06/busin