o Defense of Obama Security Stance', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Top Aide Leaps to Defense of Obama Security Stance', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baker, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Susan E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-07T02:35:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6ae1774-651c-5ade-a728-1d800db41640', 'word_count': 931, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6ae1774-651c-5ade-a728-1d800db41640'}, {'abstract': 'Johnson and the PGA provided no explanation for his six-month disappearance from the tour. In his return, Johnson missed the cut at Torrey Pines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/07/sports/dustin-johnson-falls-short-in-a-return-after-a-mysterious-hiatus.html', 'snippet': 'Johnson and the PGA provided no explanation for his six-month disappearance from the tour. In his return, Johnson missed the cut at Torrey Pines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN DIEGO — If the six-month gap in Dustin Johnson’s golf career were any more mysterious, Rose Mary Woods would be summoned from the afterlife to explain it. In his first competitive start in six months, Johnson missed a birdie putt on his last hole Friday that would have put him above the cut line at the Farmers Insurance Open.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 438}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 748, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1496, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/07/sports/Y-GOLF/Y-GOLF-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dustin Johnson Falls Short in a Return After a Mysterious Hiatus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mysterious Hiatus Ends. Then So Does a Return.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Dustin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'