imes.com/2015/02/08/business/are-ceos-that-talented-or-just-lucky.html', 'snippet': 'Using the so-called Jed Clampett defense, Harold Hamm tried to persuade a judge he was less the astute businessman than the blessed beneficiary of surging oil prices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The divorce of the oil billionaire Harold G. Hamm from Sue Ann Arnall has gained attention largely for its outsize dollar amounts. Mr. Hamm, the chief executive and founder of Continental Resources, who was worth more than $18 billion at one point, wrote his ex-wife a check last month for $974,790,317.77 to settle their split. She’s appealing to get more; he’s appealing to pay less.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/business/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/08/business/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 467}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/business/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 797, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/business/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1594, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/business/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB/8-INSIDEWEALTH1-SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/08/busin