/08/world/middleeast/overture-by-houthis-to-ousted-officials.html', 'snippet': 'Rebel leaders announced on Saturday that they had appointed four key ministers from the Yemeni government they had overthrown, but Saudi Arabia and its allies denounced the plan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANA, Yemen — Leaders of the Houthi rebels announced on Saturday that they had appointed four key ministers from the recently ousted government to a national security committee, part of their efforts to begin building institutions to replace those disbanded by their effective coup. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Saudis Unswayed by Houthi Rebels’ Overture in Yemen', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Saudis Unswayed by Houthis’ Overture', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nordland, Rod', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houthis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Almosawa, Shuaib', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Targeted Killings', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-07T18:04:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rod Nordland and Shuaib Almosawa', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rod', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nordland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'o