{'abstract': 'The Buckeyes’ D’Angelo Russell has been one of the most electrifying players in college basketball, Ohio State’s go-to option late in games since the start of the season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/08/sports/ncaabasketball/ohio-state-freshman-has-fun-and-seizes-the-national-stage.html', 'snippet': 'The Buckeyes’ D’Angelo Russell has been one of the most electrifying players in college basketball, Ohio State’s go-to option late in games since the start of the season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Antonio Russell said he lost track of time Friday sitting at a computer in his Louisville home, captivated by a YouTube highlight reel of his son.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/DOG-OSU/DOG-OSU-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/DOG-OSU/DOG-OSU-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 476}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/DOG-OSU/DOG-OSU-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 813, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/DOG-OSU/DOG-OSU-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1625, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/DOG-OSU/DOG-OSU-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/DOG-OSU/DOG-OSU-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLar