t on their holidays in famous “watering places” in Europe. “The letters should be full of news and gossip of interest to the HERALD readers” the paper wrote, a requirement that a reader with the pen name “Causeur” took very seriously. He won 1,000 francs for the following account of life in Ostende, Belgium.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/blogs/26iht-ostend/26iht-ostend-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/26/blogs/26iht-ostend/26iht-ostend-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/blogs/26iht-ostend/26iht-ostend-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 995, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/blogs/26iht-ostend/26iht-ostend-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 995, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/blogs/26iht-ostend/26iht-ostend-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/01/26/blogs/26iht-ostend/26iht-ostend-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/26/blogs/26iht-ostend/26iht-ostend-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1896: A Call for Reader Submissions', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_head