ason for Creighton Coach Greg McDermott, one filled with disappointing days and disappointing performances and disappointing results. Saturday was no exception. As he leaned against the wall outside his team’s locker room after an 84-66 loss to St. John’s at Madison Square Garden, McDermott wiped his face and exhaled.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/08CREIGHTON/08CREIGHTON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/08CREIGHTON/08CREIGHTON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 718}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/08CREIGHTON/08CREIGHTON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 856, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/08CREIGHTON/08CREIGHTON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1712, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/08CREIGHTON/08CREIGHTON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/08CREIGHTON/08CREIGHTON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/08/sports/08CREIGHTON/08CREIGHTON-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Year Later, Stumbling Creighton Grasps at Hope ', 'kicker': "St. John's 84, Creighton 66", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Year Later, Stumbling Creighton Grasps at Hope', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prunty, Brendan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Creighton University', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Madison Square Garden', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDermott, Greg (1964- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "St John's University", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-07T21:19:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brendan Prunty', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brendan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Prunty', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9405969-bfc4-57b6-83b1-6002e8751ade', 'word_count': 875, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9405969-bfc4-57b6-83b1-6002e8751ade'}, {'abstract': 'Just when it was looking bad for the Americans on their home snow in the world championships, the men’s team came up with three top-10 finishes in the downhill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/08/sports/skiing/us-recovers-in-downhill-swiss-takes-gold.html', 'snippet': 'Just when it was looking bad for the Americans on their home snow in the world championships, the men’s team came up with three top-10 finishes in the downhill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEAVER CREEK, Colo. — When the Alpine world ski championships were last on American soil, in 1999, no member of the United States team won a medal. With the championships back in Colorado this month, the event was expected to be a chance for the American racers to show how far they