nded on the force of paperwork, reams of it, to bring their opponents under control.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/world/10thaijunta-02/10thaijunta-02-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/10/world/10thaijunta-02/10thaijunta-02-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/world/10thaijunta-02/10thaijunta-02-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/world/10thaijunta-02/10thaijunta-02-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1050, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/world/10thaijunta-02/10thaijunta-02-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/10/world/10thaijunta-02/10thaijunta-02-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/world/10thaijunta-02/10thaijunta-02-thumbLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Thailand’s Junta Tries to Bury the Opposition in Endless Lawsuits', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Thailand’s Junta Tries to Bury the Opposition in Endless Lawsuits', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, '