emony, after losing the Directors Guild of America award to “Boyhood” the night before.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/09/boyhoods-bafta-wins-put-it-neck-and-neck-with-birdman/', 'snippet': 'Richard Linklater and his film won awards at the British ceremony, after losing the Directors Guild of America award to “Boyhood” the night before.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Going into Sunday, it looked like Alejandro G. Iñárritu’s “Birdman” would assuredly, in one fell feathered swoop, land the best picture and best director Oscars on Feb. 22. On Saturday night, the Directors Guild of America give the picture and Mr. Iñárritu its top award, the other major guilds — the producers’ and the actors’ — having already done the same. As several Oscar prognosticators noted, the only film that ever won all three guild awards only to lose best picture was “Apollo 13,” in 1996. (It lost to “Braveheart.”)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/arts/boyhoodbafta/boyhoodbafta-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/09/arts/boyhoodbafta/boyhoodbafta-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/arts/boyhoodbafta/boyhoodbafta-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/arts/boyhoodbafta/boyhoodbafta-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1455, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/arts/boyhoodbafta/boyhoodbafta-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/09/arts/boyhoodbafta/boyhoodbafta-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/arts/boyhoodbafta/boyhoodbafta-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Boyhood’s’ Bafta Wins Put It Neck and Neck With ‘Birdman’', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'British Academy Likes ‘Boyhood’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANDERSON, WES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cumberbatch, Benedict', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Inarritu, Alejandro G', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keaton, Michael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Linklater, Richard', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lord, Phil', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Redmayne, Eddie', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'British Academy of Film and Television', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Directors Guild of America', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-09T14:45:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cara Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b7c3143-a686-50b4-a5dd-de559a556532', 'word_count': 464, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b7c3143-a686-50b4-a5dd-de559a556532'}, {'abstract': 'The report said total government requests for data rose by 40 percent, to about 2,881, compared with the company’s last report, in July.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/09/twitter-reports-surge-in-government-data-requests/', 'snippet': 'The report said total government requests for data rose by 40 percent, to about 2,881, compared with the company’s last report, in July.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Twitter on Monday released its twice-yearly transparency report, showing a surge in government requests for users’ Twitter information. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/technology/09bits-erdogan/09bits-erdogan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/09/technology/09bits-erdogan/09bits-erdogan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/technology/09bits-erdogan/09bits-erdogan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/technology/09bits-erdogan/09bits-erdogan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1471, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/technology/09bits-erdogan/09bits-erdogan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/09/technology/09bits-erdogan/09bits-erdogan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight'