 10 performance by Paul Taylor’s Modern Dance at the David H. Koch Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/09/special-deal-on-paul-taylor-tickets-will-leave-you-money-for-burgers-too/', 'snippet': 'Tickets are priced at two for $15 for the March 10 performance by Paul Taylor’s Modern Dance at the David H. Koch Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the great bargains in New York is coming back: Paul Taylor’s newly reconstituted dance company, Paul Taylor’s American Modern Dance, is planning a March 10 performance at the David H. Koch Theater at Lincoln Center where all tickets will be two for $15.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Special Deal on Paul Taylor Tickets Will Leave You Money for Burgers, Too', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dance Bargain Leaves Money for Burgers, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taylor, Paul', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Koch, David H, Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Paul Taylor's American Modern Dance", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-09T15:24:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7281f72e-1413-54e8-9da4-0499f1e61cac', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7281f72e-1413-54e8-9da4-0499f1e61cac'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: President Lebrun visits British troops on the front in 1940.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/09/1940-lebrun-visits-british-troops/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: President Lebrun visits British troops on the front in 1940.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WITH THE BRITISH ARMY IN FRANCE — For the first time since the war began President Albert Lebrun of the French Republic visited the British Expeditionary Force today [Feb. 9]. From Paris, he came to British field headquarters in his own one-car private train. Here at the station he was met by Viscount General Gort, Commander-in-Chief of the B.E.F. The day was one of raw, humid penetrating cold. President Lebrun and his party went to the headquarters of the Welsh Guards. There they inspected some of the troops, visited their billets and chatted with a group of schoolchildren, who heralded the President’s arrival by singing the ‘‘Marseillaise.’’— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Feb. 10, 1940', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/blogs/09iht-old10-Lebrun/09iht-old10-Lebrun-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 517, 'width': 405, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/blogs/09iht-old10-Lebrun/09iht-old10-Lebrun-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 517, 'width': 405, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/09/blogs/09iht-old10-Lebrun/09iht-old10-Lebrun-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/09/blogs/09iht-old10-Lebrun/09iht-old10-Lebrun-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u