 than usual at last night’s event and opted for monochromatic, glamorous looks.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/09/grammys-2015-best-dressed-red-carpet/', 'snippet': 'Stars honored a more serious tone than usual at last night’s event and opted for monochromatic, glamorous looks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the Grammy awards, showstopping red carpet looks are usually only outdone by shocking onstage performance costumes. But this year, the most dramatic trend was the color black; and in a move as respectful and somber as many of last night’s messages (moments during the telecast acknowledged and condemned domestic and racially motivated violence), singers left their gimmicky, theatrical costumes at home. Instead they stepped out in their monochromatic and glamorous best, which was for the most part either marked by cutouts or inspired by men’s dressing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The 10 Best Dressed at the 57th Grammy Awards', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammy Awards', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Galliano, John', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCartney, Paul', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rihanna', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Valli, Giambattista', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-09T18:00:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Malina Joseph Gilchrist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Malina', 'middlename': 'Joseph', 'lastname': 'Gilchrist', 'qualifier': N