rtists this year, up from two in past years.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/09/lincoln-center-segal-awards-expand-field-of-honorees/', 'snippet': 'The Martin E. Segal Awards will be given to 11 rising artists this year, up from two in past years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the 28 years since they were established the Martin E. Segal Awards have involved a low-key luncheon that honors two rising artists chosen by two of Lincoln Center’s 11 resident organizations. Each was awarded $7,500, to be used for career advancement and future study.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lincoln Center Segal Awards Expand Field of Honorees', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Martin Segal Awards Expand Field of Honorees', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Segal, Martin E,  Awards', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barnatan, Inon', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Best, Sheldon', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biss, Jonathan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Jason Robert', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bullock, Julia', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fairchild, Robert', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fang, Ying', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Langree, Louis', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDonald, Audra', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peck, Tiler', 'rank': 15,