e tightly packed crowd.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Shows Fatal Crush at Soccer Stadium in Egypt', 'kicker': 'Open Source', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Zamalek (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stampedes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-10T00:08:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33681561-43d8-51ee-bbcc-8719fceecc9f', 'word_count': 381, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33681561-43d8-51ee-bbcc-8719fceecc9f'}, {'abstract': 'Since 2011, the crowdfunding site Kickstarter has financed thousands of wallet projects, producing ones made of wood, fire hose canvas and even leather.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/10/your-money/streamlining-the-lowly-wallet-in-a-digital-age.html', 'snippet': 'Since 2011, the crowdfunding site Kickstarter has financed thousands of wallet projects, producing ones made of wood, fire hose canvas and even leather.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At companies like Square, Apple, Google, Amazon and PayPal, to name just a few, some of the smartest programmers in the world are doing everything they can to virtualize cash registers, credit cards, receipts, coupons and probably even pockets. It is not a great time for the old-fashioned wallet. And yet apparently even Square’s founder himself is not quite ready to go out into the world completely devoid of some physical money-carrying device. “Keep it tight,” Jack Dorseytweeted a while back, with a link that led to the Americana 2.0.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/your-money/10WALLETS1/10WALLETS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/10/your-money/10WALLETS1/10WALLETS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/your-money/10WALLETS1/10WALLETS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/your-money/10WALLETS1/10WALLETS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/your-money/10WALLETS1/10WALLETS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/10/your-money/10WALLETS1/10WALLETS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/10/your-money/10WALLETS1/10WALLETS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Streamlining the Lowly Wallet in a Digital Age', 'kicker': 'Spec