es.com/times-insider/2015/02/10/daily-clip-report-120/', 'snippet': 'Good morning. Here is Daily Clip Report, a collection of articles about The Times and the media sent by email each morning to senior executives and newsroom editors. The email is produced by the Corporate Communications Department at The Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Here is Daily Clip Report, a collection of articles about The Times and the media sent by email each morning to senior executives and newsroom editors. The email is produced by the Corporate Communications Department at The Times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Clip Report', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-10T13:57:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jordan Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jordan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e201e17-eeef-58f8-bf11-51bb44f2d403', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e201e17-eeef-58f8-bf11-51bb44f2d403'}, {'abstract': 'Creating the bangle’s elaborate architecture required nearly 500 hours and the skill of 10 craftspeople.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/10/van-cleef-arpels-opart-perles-bracelet/', 'snippet': 'Creating the bangle’s elaborate architecture required nearly 500 hours and the skill of 10 craftspeople.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Van Cleef & Arpels’s beguiling, one-of-a-kind bejeweled gold cuff is a riff on 1960s Op Art. When opened and laid flat — dozens of ribs make it as flexible as rope despite its rounded heft — the bracelet appears to be made of small interlocking onyx circles dotted with diamonds. But when clasped around the wrist, the circles part to reveal a dense underlayer of cultured pearls affixed to the armature. A contrasting row of emeralds leads the way to the slyly hidden closure. Creating the bangle’s elaborate architecture required nearly 500 hours and the skill of 10 craftspeople — Van Cleef’s so-called “Mains d’Or,” or golden hands — among them a designer, a model maker, a lapidary, a gem setter and experts in hard stones, pearls and diamonds. Together, they’ve woven a rich illusion indeed.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '168', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-qual-thing/15womens-qual-thing-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-qual-thing/15womens-qual-thing-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-qual-thing/15womens-qual-thing-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-qual-thing/15womens-qual-thing-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-qual-thing/15womens-qual-thing-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15womens-qual-thing/15womens-qual-thing-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cr