s.com/2015/02/11/arts/music/review-meistersinger-wagners-playful-paean-to-culture-in-london.html', 'snippet': '“The Mastersingers of Nuremberg,” by the English National Opera, uses a light touch in its staging.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Wagner’s “Die Meistersinger” is a long opera about many things and, as hijacked by Adolf Hitler in the 1930s, those included a view of German cultural supremacy so welcoming to the Third Reich that it still bothers some of us. But more broadly it’s an opera about art at a moment of crisis, rooted in past triumphs but needing to move forward to future uncertainties. That makes it an appropriate piece for the English National Opera, whose new production, staged by Richard Jones, opened on Saturday at a moment of unsettling change and possible crisis for the company.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/11/arts/11MEISTER/11MEISTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/11/arts/11MEISTER/11MEISTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/11/arts/11MEISTER/11MEISTER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/11/arts/11MEISTER/11MEISTER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/11/arts/11MEISTER/11MEISTER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/11/arts/11MEISTER/11MEISTER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/11/arts/11MEISTER/11MEISTER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Meistersinger,’ Wagner’s Playful Paean to Culture, in London', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wagner’s Playful Paean to Culture', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wagner, Richard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English National Opera', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Die Meistersinger von Nurnberg (Opera)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-10T22:21:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael White', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'White', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1a526e6-49fe-525d-8a42-9c1848d73df1', 'word_count': 820, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1a526e6-49fe-525d-8a42-9c1848d73df1'}, {'abstract': 'As the videotape of Pedro Hernandez’s confession played, some jurors scribbled notes and others leaned forward and stared at the television monitor, studying his face.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/11/nyregion/jury-in-etan-patz-murder-trial-views-suspects-confession.html', 'snippet': 'As the videotape of Pedro Hernandez’s confession played, some jurors scribbled notes and others leaned forward and stared at the television monitor, studying his face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The c