 Clip Report is a collection of articles about the media and The Times that is emailed each day to senior executives and newsroom managers here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Here is Daily Clip Report, a collection of articles about The Times and the media sent by email each morning to senior executives and newsroom editors. The email is produced by the Corporate Communications Department at The Times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Clip Report', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-11T13:26:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jordan Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jordan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba6ca407-c28f-52b0-b46d-544d51e1ed0a', 'word_count': 199, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba6ca407-c28f-52b0-b46d-544d51e1ed0a'}, {'abstract': 'An F.M.C.S. (Fashion Month Crib Sheet) for the hundreds of shows in four cities on two continents.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/11/what-to-watch-for-during-fashion-month/', 'snippet': 'An F.M.C.S. (Fashion Month Crib Sheet) for the hundreds of shows in four cities on two continents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s here: Fashion month (I mean, really, let’s call it like it is; none of this pretend “fashion WEEK” stuff) officially starts on Thursday, though in the inveterate creep of these things, some brands have jumped the gun and are showing on Wednesday in New York.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12runway/12runway-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlar