clectic.html', 'snippet': 'The 30 shows in the festival’s ninth year should appeal to a wide variety of tastes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you think it’s chilly in New York City, it’s even colder in Toronto. So it is perhaps not surprising that several theater companies from Ontario are headed south to participate in Frigid New York. Frigid, entering its ninth year, is actually affiliated with the Canadian Association of Fringe Festivals and is modeled on its principles of first-come, first-served access for artists and a 100 percent return of box-office proceeds to those artists.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15GUIDE6/15GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 293, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15GUIDE6/15GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 293}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15GUIDE6/15GUIDE6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15GUIDE6/15GUIDE6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1001, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15GUIDE6/15GUIDE6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15GUIDE6/15GUIDE6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/1