and can build intuition about long-term investment strategies and how they can prepare for retirement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Overview | How do savings accounts grow? How can small, regular contributions add up to sizable retirement accounts? In this lesson students explore the basic mathematics of savings and interest using a simple model inspired by a recently proposed automatic retirement savings plan. By manipulating the parameters of the model and analyzing the consequences, students can build intuition about long-term investment strategies and evaluate the proposed policy from a quantitative perspective.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/business/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/business/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/business/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/01/07/business/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/01/07/business/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN/010713SUBbucks-carl-sketch-LN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy':