year at the Alpine world championships.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/sports/skiing/having-met-expectations-marcel-hirscher-is-poised-for-more.html', 'snippet': 'The 25-year-old Hirscher, a celebrity in his native Austria, could become the first man to win four gold medals in a single year at the Alpine world championships.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEAVER CREEK, Colo. — After winning the world title in the Alpine combined on Sunday, and delivering on the high expectations of his ski-crazed country, Marcel Hirscher of Austria was able to relax. So he celebrated his victory the best way he knew how: with steins of beer and plates of Wiener schnitzel at the Austria House, a temporary outpost of his homeland here in the Vail Valley complete with apple strudel, oompah bands and women wearing dirndls.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/HIRSCHERWEB/HIRSCHERWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/HIRSCHERWEB/HIRSCHERWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/HIRSCHERWEB/HIRSCHERWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/HIRSCHERWEB/HIRSCHERWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/HIRSCHERWEB/HIRSCHERWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop