ealth/smokings-health-toll-worse-than-previously-thought-study-says.html', 'snippet': 'A new analysis suggests that an additional 60,000 deaths a year in the United States are linked to smoking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'However bad you thought smoking was, it’s even worse.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/science/12smoking1/12smoking1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 240, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/12/science/12smoking1/12smoking1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 240}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/science/12smoking1/12smoking1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/science/12smoking1/12smoking1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/science/12smoking1/12smoking1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/12/science/12smoking1/12smoking1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/science/12smoking1/12smoking1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Smoking’s Toll on Health Is Even Worse Than Previously Thought, a Study Finds ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Smoking’s Toll on Health Is Even Worse Than Previously Thought, a Study Finds', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Journal of Medicine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-11T22:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denise Grady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/338c8a74-2b3d-5164-bb51-8be5a398310e', 'word_count': 947, 'uri': 'nyt://article/338c8a74-2b3d-5164-bb51-8be5a398310e'}, {'abstract': 'This West Coast jazz singer, a rhythmically adept and accomplished scat improviser, offers a far-reaching repertoire.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/arts/music/review-sara-gazarek-exudes-confidence-and-cheer.html', 'snippet': 'This West Coast jazz singer, a rhythmically adept and accomplished scat improviser, offers a far-reaching repertoire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The West Coast jazz singer Sara Gazarek, who appeared at Birdland on Tuesday evening, has many of the right moves. Rhythmically adept, she is an accomplished scat improviser who exudes an engaging blend of confidence and cheer. Her singing, at its most inventive, recalls Jane Monheit’s flights of fancy but without Ms. Monheit’s vocal lushness. She is at ease with tricky samba rhythms that break up phrases into staccato exclamations, and her far-reaching taste in songs encompasses both standards and original collaborations that take her in a pop direction.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype