ith look-at-me style statements. But fewer of those, we suspect, will be ratcheted to the heavens on sky-high heels. It’s all about sneakers now. So which will be the most popular of the season? We’re betting on these styles, some of which, like the pastel Stan Smiths reinterpreted by Raf Simons, were previewed by attendees at last month’s fashion shows in Paris. Safer passage across New York’s patches of ice is but a bonus.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12BROWSING_SPAN/12BROWSING_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12BROWSING_SPAN/12BROWSING_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 351}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12BROWSING_SPAN/12BROWSING_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 598, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12BROWSING_SPAN/12BROWSING_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1197, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12BROWSING_SPAN/12BROWSING_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12BROWSING_SPAN/12BROWSING_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12BROWSING_SPAN/12BROWSING_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'hei