r Growth, and Mark Dugan, another ranking lobbyist who previously served as Mr. Brownback’s campaign manager.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'By Their Emails Ye Shall Know Them', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Mail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lobbying and Lobbyists', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brownback, Sam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kensinger, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kansas', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-11T23:30:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Francis X. Clines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Francis', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Clines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b7f0f42-bc9a-5577-9ae1-7cd18d6e5a4a', 'word_count': 363, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b7f0f42-bc9a-5577-9ae1-7cd18d6e5a4a'}, {'abstract': 'Readers react to the suspension of the NBC News anchor and the coming departure of the “Daily Show” host.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/opinion/double-exit-brian-williams-and-jon-stewart.html', 'snippet': 'Readers react to the suspension of the NBC News anchor and the coming departure of the “Daily Show” host.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/opinion/l12tv/l12tv-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articl