4, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9910b63c-fa3b-511d-913d-217cc9792b95'}, {'abstract': 'A collection of shopping suggestions and sales.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/fashion/shopping-sales-and-events-in-new-york-city.html', 'snippet': 'A collection of shopping suggestions and sales.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not on Fashion GPS? There are still plenty of ways to take part in New York Fashion Week festivities. On Thursday, from 2 to 6 p.m. at Fivestory, you can sip pink Champagne and shop Valentine’s Day confections — Treat House Rice Krispies bars ($24 for 12), heart- and penguin-shaped New York Cake Pops ($19.99 for six) and Jars by Dani parfait-like creations ($6.25 for a four-ounce Mason jar) — from some purveyors of the fashion flock’s favorite guilty pleasures. They are not the only goodies: There’s a new Kotur x Fivestory glitter globe minaudière ($445), as well as drapey tees from the London cult T-shirt label Rotten Roach with witty slogans by the illustrator Hugo Guinness ($106) for those wanting something a little less, well, sugar-coated. At 18 East 69th Street. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12SCOUTING_COMBO/12SCOUTING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 276, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12SCOUTING_COMBO/12SCOUTING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 276}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12SCOUTING_COMBO/12SCOUTING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 471, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/fashion/12SCOUTING_COMBO/12SCOUTING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 942, 'width': 2