 School Is Giving Women Their Due', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giving the Women Their Due', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public School (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Osborne, Maxwell', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chow, Dao-Yi', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-11T23:38:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ruth La Ferla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ruth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Ferla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/148d3482-283c-5f37-b6c3-711465dc97b8', 'word_count': 1214, 'uri': 'nyt://article/148d3482-283c-5f37-b6c3-711465dc97b8'}, {'abstract': 'The Hudson River Park Trust and Pier 55 Inc. have agreed to move forward with plans to build a $130 million world-class public park and performance space on the West Side of Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/nyregion/lease-deal-for-pier-55-park-off-hudson-river-is-approved.html', 'snippet': 'The Hudson River Park Trust and Pier 55 Inc. have agreed to move forward with plans to build a $130 million world-class public park and performance space on the West Side of Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Plans for a cultural island in the Hudson River took a step forward on Wednesday, when the Hudson River Park Trust approved a lease agreement with a group controlled by Barry Diller that plans to help create a new $130 million pier with performance spaces and sylvan paths.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multim