onal claims it to be.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s a tip on choosing the perfect seats for this summer’s Little League World Series.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/LITTLELEAGUE-macur/LITTLELEAGUE1-1423699897443-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 566, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/LITTLELEAGUE-macur/LITTLELEAGUE1-1423699897443-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 566}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/LITTLELEAGUE-macur/LITTLELEAGUE1-1423699897443-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 966, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/LITTLELEAGUE-macur/LITTLELEAGUE1-1423699897443-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1919, 'width': 2035, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/LITTLELEAGUE-macur/LITTLELEAGUE1-1423699897443-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/LITTLELEAGUE-macur/LITTLELEAGUE1-1423699897443-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/sports/LITTLELEAGUE-macur/LITTLELEAGUE1-1423699897443-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Little League Scandal Shows Why Baseball Is Better Viewed From Afar', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Little League Shows Why It Shouldn’t Be Watched Too Closely', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Macur, Juliet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Little League Baseball and Softball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jackie Robinson West Little League', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Little League World Series', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-12T02:17:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Macur', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macur', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2388cb65-8363-5d23-bb39-63d665330786', 'word_count': 974, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2388cb65-8363-5d23-bb39-63d665330786'}, {'abstract': 'Armed inmates, who held a warden and a guard hostage at a prison in southern Taiwan, committed suicide early Thursday after releasing the hostages, said a Justice Ministry official, Chen Ming-tang.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/world/asia/taiwan-six-inmates-kill-themselves-official-says.html', 'snippet': 'Armed inmates, who held a warden and a guard hostage at a prison in southern Taiwan, committed suicide early Thursday after releasing the hostages, said a Justice Ministry official, Chen Ming-tang.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Six inmates at a prison in southern Taiwan killed themselves Thursday morning, ending an overnight hostage situation, a Justice Ministry official said. Two prison staff members were released unharmed after being held for 14 hours at the Kaohsiung Prison, said the official, Chen Ming-tang, a vice minister in the Justice Ministry. The six inmates, who were all serving lengthy terms for crimes that included drug trafficking and murder, apparently complained about their living conditions to get a meeting with prison officials, whom they then took hostage on Wednesday, according to local news reports. The inmates later took firearms from a prison armory, Taiwan’s Central News Agency reported. Taiwanese news outlets broadcast a series of demands from the men, including that they be provided with vehicles and that former President Chen Shui-bian, who was convicted of embezzlement and taking bribes in 2009, be returned to prison. Mr. Chen was released on medical parole in January. But early Thursday, the six inmates shot themselves, Mr. Chen, the ministry official, said in a brief televised interview. He provided few details about the episode. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taiwan: Six Inmates Kill Themselves, Official Says', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taiwan: Six Prisoners Kill Themselves, Official Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taiwan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping and Hostages', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-12T02:19:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Austin Ramzy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Austin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramzy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/0840035b-a023-5512-b441-67e891926022', 'word_count': 180, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0840035b-a023-5512-b441-67e891926022'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Gbenye, a Belgian-trained civil servant, was briefly one of several pivotal players in the seesawing civil wars waged by superpower proxies after the Belgian colonial regime left in 1960.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/world/christophe-gbenye-radical-nationalist-in-congo-dies-at-88.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Gbenye, a Belgian-trained civil servant, was briefly one of several pivotal players in the seesawing civil wars waged by superpower proxies after the Belgian colonial regime left in 1960.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christophe Gbenye, a radical nationalist whose brutal rebel warriors seized control of eastern Congo in 1964 and held hundreds of foreigners hostage until they were rescued by Belgian paratroopers dropping from American planes, died on Feb. 3 in Kinshasa. He was 88.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/world/12Gbenye-Obit/12Gbenye-Obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/12/world/12Gbenye-Obit/12Gbenye-Obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/world/12Gbenye-Obit/12Gbenye-Obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/world/12Gbenye-Obit/12Gbenye-Obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2