ere not in position outside businesses that were burned and ransacked in November, leading to intense criticism fr...', 'lead_paragraph': 'JEFFERSON CITY, Mo. — State legislators on Wednesday questioned Gov. Jay Nixon’s response last year to unrest in Ferguson as they opened hearings into how state money was spent and why a swath of suburban St. Louis was burned and looted even after the National Guard had been activated.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Response in Ferguson Draws Scrutiny', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Response in Ferguson Draws Scrutiny', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Jay', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yokley, Eli', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ferguson (Mo)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Guard', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Darren (1986- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'St Louis (Mo)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-12T02:39:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mitch Smith and Eli Yokley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mitch', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Eli', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yokley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_i