Disclosure and transparency have become a regulatory crutch.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/morning-agenda-no-agreement-on-greek-bailout/', 'snippet': 'Greece and the eurozone fail to settle their differences over debt. | Credit Suisse swings to a profit in the fourth quarter. | A corruption scandal at Petrobras is threatening Brazil’s bond market. | Disclosure and transparency have become a regu...', 'lead_paragraph': 'NO AGREEMENT ON GREEK BAILOUT | Eurozone finance ministers failed to settle their differences with Greece on Wednesday over how to keep the country from running out of money as it tries to revise the terms of its bailout, James Kanter reports in The New York Times. After holding more than five hours of talks with Yanis Varoufakis, the finance minister from the newly elected anti-austerity government in Athens, the ministers said they would need to meet again on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Agenda: No Agreement on Greek Bailout', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-12T12:14:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3782138-3df3-5bd8-a9cd-c9b2c71ab15a', 'word_count': 1899, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3782138-3df3-5bd8-a9cd-c9b2c71ab15a'}, {'abstract': 'Nadiya V. Savchenko, a former Ukrainian military lieutenant, has been charged by Russia in connection with the killings of two Russian journalists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/world/europe/as-part-of-ukraine-deal-russia-to-free-imprisoned-ukraine-pilot.html', 'snippet': 'N