ntrol-of-eastern-border-unsettled.html', 'snippet': 'The Minsk accord sets no deadline for the withdrawal of Russian forces, weapons and equipment from eastern Ukraine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The cease-fire accord announced in Minsk on Thursday was hailed by Secretary of State John Kerry and European leaders as a potential breakthrough that could finally bring the bitter conflict in Ukraine to an end.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ukraine Cease-Fire Leaves Control of Border Unresolved Until Year’s End', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-12T20:29:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael R. Gordon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Gordon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2f3941f-acd5-5a54-bb97-d8ec1e483eb8', 'word_count': 738, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2f3941f-acd5-5a54-bb97-d8ec1e483eb8'}, {'abstract': 'The Democrats’ choice of Philadelphia to host their 2016 national convention is a rare win in a heated rivalry that most Philadelphians feel passionate about and many New Yorkers tend to ignore.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/02/12/with-convention-phildelphia-scores-rare-win-over-new-york/', 'snippet': 'The Democrats’ choice of Philadelphia to host their 2016 national convention is a rare win in a heated rivalry that most Philadelphians feel passionate about and m