2/12/f-b-i-director-james-comey-on-how-everyones-a-little-bit-racist/', 'snippet': 'How will Republicans respond to his frank speech?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hostility that Republican lawmakers and conservative commentators directed at Attorney General Eric Holder when he spoke openly – and truthfully — about racial profiling was clearly related to the fact that Mr. Holder is black. How will the same politicians and talking heads respond to a similarly frank speech that the F.B.I. director James B. Comey, who is white, delivered at Georgetown University today?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/opinion/2122015comey/2122015comey-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/12/opinion/2122015comey/2122015comey-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/opinion/2122015comey/2122015comey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/opinion/2122015comey/2122015comey-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/opinion/2122015comey/2122015comey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/12/opinion/2122015comey/2122015comey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12