lifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/092bceba-d682-5b0f-8bab-9e921098a38f', 'word_count': 1154, 'uri': 'nyt://article/092bceba-d682-5b0f-8bab-9e921098a38f'}, {'abstract': 'The filmmaker introduces her newest bottle of wine —\xa0and suggests some nice chocolates to enjoy with it.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/12/sofia-coppola-red-wine/', 'snippet': 'The filmmaker introduces her newest bottle of wine —\xa0and suggests some nice chocolates to enjoy with it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sixteen years ago, the filmmaker and vintner Francis Ford Coppola named a personal batch of blanc de blancs sparkling wine after his effervescent daughter Sofia, who loved it so much that they decided to produce it on a larger scale and sell it to the public. The blend, best known as the bubbly packaged in chic little raspberry-colored cans (accompanied by miniature straws), became the first Coppola wine named after Sofia. To date, the collection has also included a non-alcoholic sparkling beverage, an off-dry riesling, a refreshing rosé and a soft, versatile chardonnay. And this Saturday, on Valentine’s Day, Coppola introduces the first bottle of red to bear her name, with a flavor profile designed, in part, by her.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/t-magazine/12sofia-beddie/12sofia-beddie-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/12/t-magazine/12sofia-beddie/12sofia-beddie-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/t-magazine/12sofia-beddie/12sofia-beddie-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/t-magazine/12sofia-beddie/12sofia-beddie-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/t-magazine/12sofia-beddie/12sofia-beddie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/12/t-magazine/12sofia-beddie/12sofia-beddie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/t-magazine/12sofia-beddie/12sofia-beddie-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sofia Coppola’s Juicy Red Valentine', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Valentine's Day", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coppola, Francis Ford', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coppola, Sofia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-12T22:15:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Donnelly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Donnelly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/93accd91-efc3-5c18-b67c-c7a7e4089a8c', 'word_count': 385, 'uri': 'nyt://article/93accd91-efc3-5c18-b67c-c7a7e4089a8c'}, {'abstract': 'Included in the company’s opening-night show on Tuesday at the Joyce Theater were four variations on Graham’s 1930 “Lamentation.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/arts/dance/review-martha-graham-dance-revisits-a-classic-in-gala.html', 'snippet': 'Included in the company’s opening-night show on Tuesday at the Joyce Theater were four variations on Graham’s 1930 “Lamentation.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Martha Graham Dance Company, founded in 1926, is always searching for ways to stay relevant: cleverly reinventing classics, commissioning new works from trendy choreographers. For its current season at the Joyce Theater, its artistic director, Janet Eilber, has enlisted even bigger, more recognizable names than usual, more determined than ever, it seems, to broaden the troupe’s appeal. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13GALA/13GALA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13GALA/13GALA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 605}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13GALA/13GALA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1017, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13GALA/13GALA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2033, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13GALA/13GALA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thu