ble in the Market, It’s Well Inflated', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reyburn, Scott', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Christie's", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-12T22:16:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Reyburn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reyburn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27f2e4f5-930a-5f29-b66a-3e0fa8ea618c', 'word_count': 990, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27f2e4f5-930a-5f29-b66a-3e0fa8ea618c'}, {'abstract': 'Ethel Payne, an African-American journalist, is the subject of an important and often absorbing biography by James McGrath Morris.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/books/review-the-reporter-ethel-payne-in-eye-on-the-struggle.html', 'snippet': 'Ethel Payne, an African-American journalist, is the subject of an important and often absorbing biography by James McGrath Morris.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During its heyday in the first half of the 20th century, The Chicago Defender was America’s premier black newspaper. Every issue carried its blazing motto: “American Race Prejudice Must Be Destroyed.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13BOOK/13BOOK-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 902, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13BOOK/13BOOK-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 902}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13BOOK/13BOOK-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13BOOK/13BOOK-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1363, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13BOOK/13BOOK-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13BOOK/13BOOK-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13BOOK/13BOOK-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: The Reporter Ethel Payne in ‘Eye on the Struggle’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'This Reporter Got There First', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Dwight', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morris, James McGrath', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Payne, Ethel L (1911-91)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Eye on the Struggle: Ethel Payne, the First Lady of the Black Press (Book)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-12T22:19:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dwight Ga