nytimes.com/2015/02/13/movies/review-in-kingsman-the-secret-service-colin-firth-get-his-suits-splattered.html', 'snippet': 'There’s a fine cast — including Michael Caine, Mark Strong and Samuel L. Jackson — as well as exploding heads and endangered dogs in Matthew Vaughn’s gory action movie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you don’t mind the church full of parishioners who are slaughtered to the sounds of Lynyrd Skynyrd’s “Free Bird” or the “Arab terrorists” who are blown to smithereens or the guns that are pointed at pet dogs or the human heads that explode like firebombed melons as “Pomp and Circumstance” plays, it may be possible to enjoy “Kingsman: The Secret Service.” That said, as this bludgeoning movie grinds to a halt, its gears clogged by viscera and narrative overkill, even those who enjoy go-go gore may end up yearning for the soft touch and subtleties of Guy Ritchie.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13KINGSMANJP/13KINGSMANJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13KINGSMANJP/13KINGSMANJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13KINGSMANJP/13KINGSMANJP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13KINGSMANJP/13KINGSMANJP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13KINGSMANJP/13KINGSMANJP-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13KINGSMANJP/13KINGSMANJP-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13KINGSMANJP/13KINGSMANJP-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘Kingsman: The Secret Service,’ Colin Firth Get His Suits Splattered', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Flying Gore Can Ruin One’s Bespoke Suits', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vaughn, Matthew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caine, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Firth, Colin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Samuel L', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strong, Mark', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Kingsman: The Secret Service (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goldman, Jane (1970- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T01:03:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/6bb4881f-40e1-520c-b27b-27513d05dad5', 'word_count': 458, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6bb4881f-40e1-520c-b27b-27513d05dad5'}, {'abstract': 'An effort to fund the state program that provides driver’s licenses to undocumented immigrants has failed, leaving the program with little ability to function.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/us/colorado-senate-rejects-funding-plan-for-drivers-licenses-for-immigrants.html', 'snippet': 'An effort to fund the state program that provides driver’s licenses to undocumented immigrants has failed, leaving the program with little ability to function.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An effort to fund the state program that provides driver’s licenses to undocumented immigrants has failed, leaving the program with little ability to function. On Thursday, State Senator Jessie Ulibarri, a Democrat, submitted an amendment that would have assigned funds collected from immigrant applicants to pay for the program. The Republican-controlled Senate voted down the measure. Unauthorized immigrants can receive driver’s licenses in 10 states, the District of Columbia and Puerto Rico. Colorado’s program began in 2014, and state motor vehicle offices issuing these license have been swamped with requests from immigrants. But critics maintain that the program rewards people who have crossed into the country without authorization. Last month, the state’s joint budget committee voted not to approve about $166,000 in new funds for the program, forcing officials to lay off workers and stop issuing the licenses at four of the five participating motor vehicle offices. One office, in Denver, was left to process the licenses. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Colorado: Senate Rejects Funding Plan for Driver’s Licenses for Immigrants', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Rockies', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Colorado: Senate Rejects Funding Plan for Driver’s Licenses for Immigrants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drivers Licenses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject'