/13/opinion/an-iraqis-plea-to-the-us.html', 'snippet': 'Atheel al-Nujaifi, the governor of Nineveh Province, responds to an Op-Ed article.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Iraqi’s Plea to the U.S.', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Iraqi’s Plea to the U.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nineveh (Iraq)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mosul (Iraq)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nujaifi, Atheel al-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T08:27:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e3d988f-dd5a-5f98-adb3-2141a5378741', 'word_count': 197, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e3d988f-dd5a-5f98-adb3-2141a5378741'}, {'abstract': 'The National Center for Health Research responds to an editorial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/opinion/keep-the-medical-device-tax.html', 'snippet': 'The National Center for Health Research responds to an editorial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Keep the Medical Device Tax', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Keep the Medical Device Tax', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medical Devices', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T08:27:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb5b20c8-00cc-5516-9cc8-90cdcd8211c0', 'word_count': 238, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb5b20c8-00cc-5516-9cc8-90cdcd8211c0'}, {'abstract': 'There should be no easing of sanctions until the Russian president shows a willingness to live by the agreements reached in Minsk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/opinion/making-the-ukraine-cease-fire-stick.html', 'snippet': 'There should be no easing of sanctions until the Russian president shows a willingness to live by the agreements reached in Minsk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A “glimmer of hope” but “no illusion” was the inauspicious way Angela Merkel, the German chancellor, described the Ukraine cease-fire she and President François Hollande of France brokered in talks in Minsk, Belarus, with Presidents Vladimir Putin of Russia and Petro Poroshenko of Ukraine. Ms. Merkel certainly deserves a lot of credit for her determined shuttling among Kiev, Moscow, Munich, Washington and Minsk in the urgent search for a resolution of the biggest security crisis to confront Europe since the end of the Cold War.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/opinion/13fri1WEB/13fri1WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/13/opinion/13fri1WEB/13fri1WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/opinion/13fri1WEB/13fri1WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': No