/15/magazine/reply-all-the-2-115-issue.html', 'snippet': 'Readers respond.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOM BRADY CANNOT STOP', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/magazine/01cover_text/01cover_text-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/01/magazine/01cover_text/01cover_text-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 730}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/magazine/01cover_text/01cover_text-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 842, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/magazine/01cover_text/01cover_text-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1684, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/magazine/01cover_text/01cover_text-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/01/magazine/01cover_text/01cover_text-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/01/magazine/01cover_text/01cover_text-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Reply All: The 2.1.15 Issue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Reply All: The 2.1.15 Issue', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T11:58:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78aafd36-460a-5e44-8aed-5f25ff135c22', 'word_count': 771, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78aafd36-460a-5e44-8aed-5f25ff135c22'}, {'abstract': 'We had a language for everything, except what happened in the barber’s chair.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/magazine/the-short-cut.html', 'snippet': 'We had a language for everything, except what happened in the barber’s chair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was in high school in the Midwest, in the early 50s, we all had crew cuts. Maybe, at times, we simply had short hair — anything other than short hair would have been somewhere between unfashionable and suicidal — but the hairstyle that engaged our connoisseurship was the crew cut. I was convinced that the barber many of us patronized gave the best crew cuts in the city. Anyone who believes that there is no room for artistry when dealing with an inch or so of hair never sat in this man’s chair.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '54', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/magazine/15lives/15lives-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 942, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/magazine/15lives/15lives-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 942}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/magazine/15lives/15lives-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 653, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/magazine/15lives/15lives-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1629, 'width': 1038, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop