', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/arts/television/tune-in-slim-50-ways-to-be-entertained-by-love.html', 'snippet': 'TV has no shortage of shows ready to help you meet, retain, reinvent, impress or leave your lover.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Confused about love as Valentine’s Day weekend arrives? Not sure how to get into, improve, reinvent or get out of a relationship? You obviously haven’t been watching enough television. With all due respect to “Fifty Shades of Grey” on its debut weekend, it’s the “50 Ways” song that comes to mind here, with 50 TV shows standing ready to help you meet, retain, change, impress or leave your lover: ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13LOVERS1/13LOVERS1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13LOVERS1/13LOVERS1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 678}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13LOVERS1/13LOVERS1-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 906, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13LOVERS1/13LOVERS1-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1185, 'width': 1048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13LOVERS1/13LOVERS1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/13/arts/13LOVERS1/13LOVERS1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 