middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Khan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00de5590-aac9-5c96-82f2-779c5a3d26ea', 'word_count': 654, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00de5590-aac9-5c96-82f2-779c5a3d26ea'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: Taxis in Paris impose a new, universal tariff and meter in 1890.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/1890-taxi-tariff-approved-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: Taxis in Paris impose a new, universal tariff and meter in 1890.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The committee of the Chambre Syndicale des Cocher has accepted the principle of the ‘‘compteur horo-kilométrique,’’ and all the Paris cabs will have to be supplied within eighteen months.\xa0Though the mechanism of the ‘‘compteurs’’ may differ, no special model having been chosen, the exterior plate will be of a uniform type for the convenience of the public. It will be fastened to the box in such a position that it will face the occupant of the cab, and that the light of one of the lamps will fall on it. M.\xa0 Alphand will make his report to the Municipal Council on Monday next. He proposes to fix the tariff for a cab at 25 centimes per kilomètre, plus 50 centimes for the hire of the vehicle. The clock is intended to show the amount of time the cab may have been kept waiting. Two francs an hour will be charged in cases of this kind. — The New York Herald, European Edition, Feb. 14, 1890', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/blogs/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis-jumbo.png', 'height': 549, 'width': 311, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/blogs/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis-superJumbo.png', 'height': 549, 'width': 311, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/blogs/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/14/blogs/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/blogs/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis/14iht-oldfeb14-taxis-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1890: Taxi Tariff Approved in Paris', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxicabs and Taxicab Drivers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T14:53:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a411c246-c501-532c-aa55-7308d2f98d31', 'word_count': 165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a411c246-c501-532c-aa55-7308d2f98d31'}, {'abstract': 'Paul Thomas Anderson yelled at him, and he stuck to his guns about stars: “They’re not that important.”', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/when-the-first-bagger-dav