 worldwide, smartphones, Topol says, “are the most rapidly adopted technology in the history of man.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/books/review/15JAUHARSUB/15JAUHARSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 2158, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/books/review/15JAUHARSUB/15JAUHARSUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 2158}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/books/review/15JAUHARSUB/15JAUHARSUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 285, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/books/review/15JAUHARSUB/15JAUHARSUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 570, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/books/review/15JAUHARSUB/15JAUHARSUB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/books/review/15JAUHARSUB/15JAUHARSUB-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/books/review/15JAUHARSUB/15JAUHARSUB-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Patient Will See You Now,’ by Eric Topol', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Doctor Is On', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jauhar, San