ttempt to acquire the Botox maker Allergan last year, is now in talks with Salix, according to a person briefed on the matter. The British drug maker Shire, too, is interested.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/02/13/drug-maker-salix-is-once-again-a-potential-takeover-target/', 'snippet': 'Valeant, which failed in its attempt to acquire the Botox maker Allergan last year, is now in talks with Salix, according to a person briefed on the matter. The British drug maker Shire, too, is interested.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Salix’s stock is up 50 percent in the last three months on speculation about a deal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drug Maker Salix Is Once Again a Potential Takeover Target', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Salix Pharmaceuticals Ltd', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shire PLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Valeant Pharmaceuticals International Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T17:35:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gelles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gelles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b88969ab-b4a1-5ce5-8c72-70f8c7883b80', 'word_count': 380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b88969ab-b4a1-5ce5-8c72-70f8c7883b80'}, {'abstract': 'Some recognizable names have left Hot 97, while outside voices have come in. And that raises concerns about the station’s status as a top rap outlet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/14/arts/music/hot-97-a-hip-hop-pioneer-on-radio-reaches-a-crossroads.html', 'snippet': 'Some recognizable names have left Hot 97, while outside voices have come in. And that raises concerns about the station’s status as a top rap outlet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two familiar New York voices shared the radio airwaves on Thursday, talking as usual about hip-hop, but up higher on the dial. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14HOT97/14HOT97-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14HOT97/14HOT97-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14HOT97/14HOT97-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 596, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14HOT97/14HOT97-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1192, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14HOT97/14HOT97-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14HOT97/14HOT97-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14HOT97/14HOT97-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Hip-Hop Radio and Its Voices, Change Is on the Air', 'kicker': None, 'c