istina Fernández de Kirchner by Alberto Nisman, whose mysterious death has gripped the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BUENOS AIRES — A federal prosecutor in Argentina on Friday revived the explosive accusations leveled by Alberto Nisman, the prosecutor whose mysterious death has gripped the country, by seeking to charge President Cristina Fernández de Kirchner with shielding Iranians from responsibility over a 1994 bombing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prosecutor Puts Leader of Argentina on Defensive', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prosecutor Puts Leader of Argentina on Defensive', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirchner, Cristina Fernandez de', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nisman, Alberto', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romero, Simon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARGENTINA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollicita, Gerardo', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T19:47:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Gilbert and Simon Romero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gilbert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b30a420e-9908-5d65-9b8d-a70d65af26ae', 'word_count': 866, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b30a420e-9908-5d65-9b8d-a70d65af26ae'}, {'abstract': 'Questions about email etiquette, helping out a minimum-wage earner, whether to give a second gift and how to ask a friend to wear his hearing aid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/style/social-qs-please-get-back-to-me.html', 'snippet': 'Questions about email etiquette, helping out a minimum-wage earner, whether to give a second gift and how to ask a friend to wear his hearing aid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have been close with a family member since she was a little girl. She is now the mother of two young children. I am also a mother, so I know how time-consuming that is. But I don’t understand why she has time to post on Facebook but doesn’t have time to answer my emails. I have tried commenting on her posts, but that doesn’t work, either. I am a baby boomer, and she is a Gen X-er. Can you explain what’s going on? Anonymous', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbna