ct', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMATED FILMS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferguson, Craig', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DreamWorks Animation SKG Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T21:39:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30f146e0-4354-5fe7-bfcd-78e35250193b', 'word_count': 67, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30f146e0-4354-5fe7-bfcd-78e35250193b'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Mariotti will bring his interpretation of Rossini’s “La Donna del Lago” to New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/arts/music/michele-mariotti-to-conduct-at-the-metropolitan-opera.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Mariotti will bring his interpretation of Rossini’s “La Donna del Lago” to New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The young conductor Michele Mariotti’s precocious eminence in bel canto opera isn’t, perhaps, such a surprise. As a child, he made batons out of skewers and Champagne corks, waving them along to recordings.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15CONDUCTOR1/15CONDUCTOR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15CONDUCTOR1/15CONDUCTOR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 766}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15CONDUCTOR1/15CONDUCTOR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 802, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'le