nt': 1522, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1cc7bdd-0073-57e1-83b8-fa8a898a9546'}, {'abstract': 'Emma Marwood was in the middle of a two-year assignment in Mexico as a foreign service worker when she found Miguel Palafox, who decided he was more than happy to travel the world with her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/fashion/weddings/ready-to-travel-the-world-together.html', 'snippet': 'Emma Marwood was in the middle of a two-year assignment in Mexico as a foreign service worker when she found Miguel Palafox, who decided he was more than happy to travel the world with her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Emma Marwood found her calling early. A high school exchange trip to Mexico first sparked her interest in living abroad, and the war in Iraq opened her eyes to the complexities of international affairs.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ready to Travel the World Together', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ready to Travel the World Together', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vows (Times Column)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-13T21:42:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Malkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Malkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60ba3bc6-4c43-52d0-bc82-69aff6209031', 'word_count': 1764, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60ba3bc6-4c43-52d0-bc82-69aff6209031'}, {'abstract': 'Diana Byer’s company begins a new chapter with a studio at St. Mark’s Church, an updated repertory and a season at New York Live Arts in Chelsea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/arts/dance/new-york-theater-ballet-moves-itsreleves-downtown.html', 'snippet': 'Diana Byer’s company begins a new chapter with a studio at St. Mark’s Church, an updated repertory and a season at New York Live Arts in Chelsea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At a recent informal performance hosted by New York Theater Ballet at St. Mark’s Church, 40 or so people crammed into a studio on the second floor. Children sat cross-legged. Two company members danced an Agnes de Mille pas de deux. The production manager, also a puppeteer, did a melancholy number with a wooden board as a prop. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15NEW1/15NEW1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15NEW1/15NEW1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 593}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15NEW1/15NEW1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1012, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15NEW1/15NEW1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2024, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15NEW1/15NEW1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/arts/15NEW1/15NEW1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':