 network around the market, so that Main Street can follow along with Wall Street.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/nyregion/an-app-invstr-is-a-financial-primer.html', 'snippet': 'A new app called Invstr constructs a gaming platform and a social network around the market, so that Main Street can follow along with Wall Street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the film “The Wolf of Wall Street,” there’s a scene in which the firm run by Leonardo DiCaprio’s character is taking another company public. His character turns to the camera and starts to explain what an initial public offering is. Then he interrupts himself. “I know you’re not following what I’m saying anyway, right?” he says, laughing at an audience he considers too unsophisticated to understand.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15APPCITYSUB/15APPCITYsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 561, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15APPCITYSUB/15APPCITYsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 561}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15APPCITYSUB/15APPCITYsub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 958, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15APPCITYSUB/15APPCITYsub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1775, 'width': 1897, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15APPCITYSUB/15APPCITYsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac