', 'word_count': 613, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4bcb638-0d9f-5796-9e42-bfdf15f13f53'}, {'abstract': 'The rapper Drake, who has released his new mixtape, “If You’re Reading This It’s Too Late,” has built his career on Kanye Westian principles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/14/arts/music/drake-and-kanye-west-proven-paths-to-stardom.html', 'snippet': 'The rapper Drake, who has released his new mixtape, “If You’re Reading This It’s Too Late,” has built his career on Kanye Westian principles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kanye West’s debut album, “The College Dropout,” ends with a rambling recitation, “Last Call.” In it, he recalls the conspicuous consumption of his younger years: “Get a Pelle Pelle off layaway, get some Jordans or something/Or get a TechnoMarine, that’s what we wore back then.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14DRAKE1/14DRAKE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14DRAKE1/14DRAKE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14DRAKE1/14DRAKE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14DRAKE1/14DRAKE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1493, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/arts/14DRAKE1/14DRAKE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'ima