l for Women, and knew there was another New York. Soon she found it: the dark new bohemia that was just then supplanting the earnest folk-singing scene of Macdougal Street. She was home.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15BETSYJP1/15BETSYJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15BETSYJP1/15BETSYJP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15BETSYJP1/15BETSYJP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15BETSYJP1/15BETSYJP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1537, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15BETSYJP1/15BETSYJP1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15BETSYJP1/15BETSYJP1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15BETSYJP1/15BETSYJP1-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Betsey Johnson: A Role Model, Still', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Role Model, Still', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Betsey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nineteen Hundred Sixties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dresses', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-14T00:34:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheila Weller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheila', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d7bd1843-5fc6-5a3e-8912-367734ce81d1', 'word_count': 2369, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d7bd1843-5fc6-5a3e-8912-367734ce81d1'}, {'abstract': 'Addicted to homemade videos about animals, the author knows he is not alone. Many viewers seem to connect such joys to a healing experience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/style/in-praise-of-the-cute-animal-video.html', 'snippet': 'Addicted to homemade videos about animals, the author knows he is not alone. Many viewers seem to connect such joys to a healing experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It started with the wombat. Or was it the big blackbird that for reasons unexplained, landed and loitered on a man’s guitar while he skillfully played “Blackbird” by the Beatles? Or did it start with the raccoon sitting up on its hind legs and putting its agile little paws in the mouth of a beagle to give what looked like an unusually thorough checkup?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15CULTURAL1/15CULTURAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15CULTURAL1/15CULTURAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15CULTURAL1/15CULTURAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15CULTURAL1/15CULTURAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1319, 'width': 1964, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15CULTURAL1/15CULTURAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15CULTURAL1/15CULTURAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/fashion/15CULTURAL1/15CULTURAL1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Praise of the Cute Animal Video', 'kicker': 'Cultural Studies', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rolling Over for Cute Animal Videos', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMALS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-14T00:35:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bob Morris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/789895bd-f4b8-5bfd-8099-b9469d5d1efe', 'word_count': 1112, 'uri': 'nyt://article/789895bd-f4b8-5bfd-8099-b9469d5d1efe'}, {'abstract': 'Patrick Kwan, an antismoking advocate, writes that “there is no safe level of secondhand smoke exposure.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/14/opinion/smoke-free-policies.html', 'snippet': 'Patrick Kwan, an antismoking advocate, writes that “there is no safe level of secondhand smoke exposure.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Smoke-Free Policies', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Smoke-Free Policies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-14T00:35:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/45416276-b856-5920-9580-2497f31546ef', 'word_count': 127, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45416276-b856-5920-9580-2497f31546ef'}, {'abstract': 'The mother of Jason Rezaian, The Washington Post’s Tehran correspondent, who has been incarcerated without publicly explained charges since July 22, said Friday that she feared new delays in his trial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/14/world/middleeast/iran-delays-feared-in-reporters-trial.html', 'snippet': 'The mother of Jason Rezaian, The Washington Post’s Tehran correspondent, who has been incarcerated without publicly explained charges since July 22, said Friday that she feared new delays in his trial.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The mother of Jason Rezaian, The Washington Post’s Tehran correspondent, who has been incarcerated without publicly explained charges since July 22, said Friday that she feared new delays in his trial, and that the Iranian authorities had sharply curtailed prison visits from Mr. Rezaian’s Iranian wife. Mr. Rezaian was formally charged in January, even though the judiciary has not disclosed any details. His mother, Mary Rezaian, said that under Iranian law, Mr. Rezaian should be put on trial by early March, within 60 days after formal charges are set. But now, she said, “there are rumblings” that her son’s case will not be heard until after the Persian New Year holiday, which falls on March 21 and lasts for about two weeks, “so it can only be assumed his trial date might not be set before April 6.” Mrs. Rezaian, an American who lives in Turkey, made the assertions in a written commentary posted on CNN’s website. American officials and The Post have repeatedly called on Iran to release Mr. Rezaian, 38, a dual Iranian-American citizen. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran: Delays Feared in Reporter’s Trial', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iran: Delays Feared in Reporter’s Trial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rezaian, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Prisoners', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Post', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-14T00:41:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 're