'nyt://article/235b3e3d-f4fa-5a60-abc2-9ca345951733'}, {'abstract': 'With unexpected ingredients and preparations, Artisanal Burger Company, in Manchester, puts a twist on usual pub food.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/nyregion/a-review-of-artisanal-burger-company-in-manchester.html', 'snippet': 'With unexpected ingredients and preparations, Artisanal Burger Company, in Manchester, puts a twist on usual pub food.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Connecticut there’s no better culinary success story than that of Dorjan Puka, a self-taught chef who immigrated from Albania at 23 after winning a green-card lottery, labored a dozen years in various restaurants, then opened two superb places of his own, Treva and À Vert Brasserie, in West Hartford. Now Mr. Puka has taken his act east of the river, with the Artisanal Burger Company, just off the highway in Manchester’s Buckland Hills. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15DINECT2/15DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15DINECT2/15DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15DINECT2/15DINECT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15DINECT2/15DINECT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/nyregion/15DINECT2/15DINECT2-thumbSta