nds” and the one whose name he can’t remember. And major breakthroughs in science and love are the highlights of six episodes of “The Big Bang Theory,” beginning at 8 p.m.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Saturday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Saturday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-14T06:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lori Holcomb-Holland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lori', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holcomb-Holland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/85b6c0d8-c00e-5459-8a9e-cd9b00a27892', 'word_count': 672, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85b6c0d8-c00e-5459-8a9e-cd9b00a27892'}, {'abstract': 'The creation of Dodgertown helped Jackie Robinson and the Brooklyn Dodgers deal with segregation in Florida’s Grapefruit League.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/upshot/when-jim-crow-got-cut-from-spring-training.html', 'snippet': 'The creation of Dodgertown helped Jackie Robinson and the Brooklyn Dodgers deal with segregation in Florida’s Grapefruit League.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here, in March 1947, Jackie Robinson, who was vying to become the first African-American in Major League Baseball in the modern era, obliges an autograph seeker during spring training in Havana.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/12/upshot/15UP-Robinson/15UP-Robinson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 475, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop