resident Obama’s request for an authorization of force against the Islamic State on the Sunday network shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama asked Congress for formal authorization to use military force against the Islamic State terrorist group this week, which lawmakers will debate in committee hearings this month. Senator Bob Corker, Republican of Tennessee and chairman of the Foreign Relations Committee, will talk about the upcoming hearings on CBS’s “Face the Nation,” along with Denis McDonough, the White House chief of staff.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We’re Watching: Sunday Shows', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaine, Timothy M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCain, John', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moore, Roy S', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reed, Jack', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-14T19:34:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elena Schneider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schneider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fa1ba5b-ad73-5397-87b0-dfad0269f242', 'word_count': 274, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fa1ba5b-ad73-5397-87b0-dfad0269f242'}, {'abstract': 'With all the festivities packed into the All-Star weekend, the game itself has become just one entertainment option. It was not always this way, according to former players.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/sports/basketball/past-nba-all-stars-recall-a-more-competitive-game.html', 'snippet': 'With all the festivities packed into the All-Star weekend, the game itself has become just one entertainment option. It was not always this way, according to former players.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the striking sights of last year’s N.B.A. All-Star Game — the dunks, the no-look passes and the general tomfoolery — was the final score.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/sports/DOG-15allstar/DOG-15allstar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 817, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/sports/DOG-15allstar/DOG-15allstar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 817}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/sports/DOG-15allstar/DOG-15allstar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 753, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/sports/DOG-15allstar/DOG-15allstar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1505, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/sports/DOG-15allstar/DOG-15allstar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/sports/DOG-15allstar/DOG-15allstar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt