he hairstylist Guido Palau made this evening at Alexander Wang’s fall 2015 show. Inspired by heavy metal, they together created a beautifully gothic and gloomy look. “I’m keeping the skin very pale, with a dark brown and gray greasy feel on the eye,” Kendal explained. With a clean brush, she dragged the eye makeup (Aigle Noir Velvet Shadow Stick, Transvaal Eye Paint, Bellissima Duo Eyeshadow and Vientiane Matte Multiple, all by Nars) downward, to create the effect of “a hint of dark circle,” as Kendal put it, around the models’ eyes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/t-magazine/14beauty-wang/14beauty-wang-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/14/t-magazine/14beauty-wang/14beauty-wang-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/t-magazine/14beauty-wang/14beauty-wang-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/t-magazine/14beauty-wang/14beauty-wang-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1537, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/14/t-magazine/14beauty-wang/14beauty-wang-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/14/t-magazine/14beauty-wang/14beauty-wang-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'