 was “prejudicial to the national interest” and would hurt India’s image abroad.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'India Blocked an Activist From Traveling to Britain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'India Blocked an Activist From Traveling to Britain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Najar, Nida', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Greenpeace', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Modi, Narendra', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-14T23:31:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nida Najar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nida', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Najar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eac48c9f-d4ee-5245-b485-fbd165fc14bf', 'word_count': 794, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eac48c9f-d4ee-5245-b485-fbd165fc14bf'}, {'abstract': 'Drought and the pumping of water have depleted the delta smelt and the delicate ecosystem they inhabit, prompting limits on the amount of water sent to farmers and cities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/us/threatened-smelt-touches-off-battles-in-californias-endless-water-wars.html', 'snippet': 'Drought and the pumping of water have depleted the delta smelt and the delicate ecosystem they inhabit, prompting limits on the amount of water sent to farmers and cities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO VISTA, Calif. — On a boat in the heart of California’s biggest river delta,