', 'word_count': 593, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7b37395-e6ef-573b-8454-4f40ddf74d55'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The actress was scheduled to have her right leg amputated in 1915 after years of osteoarthritis.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/1915-amputation-scheduled-for-sarah-bernhardt/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The actress was scheduled to have her right leg amputated in 1915 after years of osteoarthritis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In connection with the postponement of the operation which Mme. Sarah Bernhardt was to have undergone Sunday [Feb. 14], it is now announced that it’s a question of amputating her right leg, and the delay is occasioned because of a decision to carry out a preparatory treatment lasting about ten days. Mme. Bernhardt was lately taken from Arcachon to a private hospital in Bordeaux, where the operation was to have taken place on Sunday, but after a consultation, a postponement was thought advisable.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/blogs/15iht-old16/15iht-old16-jumbo.png', 'height': 425, 'width': 308, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/blogs/15iht-old16/15iht-old16-superJumbo.png', 'height': 425, 'width': 308, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/blogs/15iht-old16/15iht-old16-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/blogs/15iht-old16/15iht-old16-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 's