he Ludlow Hotel that drew a smattering of celebrities including Mary J. Blige and Naomi Campbell. See the photos.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fashion Week Parties: Night 3', 'kicker': 'Scene City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Moncler', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-15T19:42:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jacob Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jacob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c9902b5-6734-59d3-a80a-e400c5215cc1', 'word_count': 27, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c9902b5-6734-59d3-a80a-e400c5215cc1'}, {'abstract': 'The hairstylist Orlando Pita was inspired to create the style by a pair of bell-bottom trousers in the designer’s collection.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/15/derek-lam-beauty-fall-2015/', 'snippet': 'The hairstylist Orlando Pita was inspired to create the style by a pair of bell-bottom trousers in the designer’s collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inspired by a pair of bell-bottom trousers from Derek Lam’s fall 2015 collection, the hairstylist Orlando Pita mimicked the wide shape in a textured ponytail. To get the look, Pita blow-dried the hair using, depending on the density of the model’s tresses, either Phyto’s Phytovolume Actif or Phyto’s Intense Volume mousse for texture. He kept the top portion slick and tidy, with an off-center, controlled part, and pulled the rest back into a ponytail at the nape of the neck, finishing the look with Phyto Phytolaque Soie hairspray. And, for a little extra interest: “We have this accessory in the hair, in the ponytail, which women would use in the ’70s when I went to high school,” Pita said. “We made a streamlined New York version for today.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15bsb-dereklam/15bsb-dereklam-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 904, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15bsb-dereklam/15bsb-dereklam-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 904}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15bsb-dereklam/15bsb-dereklam-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 680, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15bsb-dereklam/15bsb-dereklam-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1360, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15bsb-dereklam/15bsb-dereklam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15bsb-dereklam/15bsb-dereklam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/15/t-magazine/15bsb-dereklam/15bsb-dereklam-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Derek Lam’s Simple, Pretty ’70s-Inspired Ponytail', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headl