1'}, {'abstract': 'The violinist Anne-Sophie Mutter\xa0was the accompanying soloist for the ensemble, which was conducted by Cristian Macelaru.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/16/arts/music/review-danish-national-symphony-orchestra-honors-sibelius-and-nielsen-at-carnegie-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The violinist Anne-Sophie Mutter\xa0was the accompanying soloist for the ensemble, which was conducted by Cristian Macelaru.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As anniversaries go, a sesquicentennial may lack the obvious punch of a centennial or bicentennial. (Don’t bother to look it up; a sesquicentennial is a 150th anniversary.) But the classical-music world will take any anniversary it can get.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/arts/16SIBELIUS/16SIBELIUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/16/arts/16SIBELIUS/16SIBELIUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/arts/16SIBELIUS/16SIBELIUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/arts/16SIBELIUS/16SIBELIUS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1376, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/arts/16SIBELIUS/16SIBELIUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/16/arts/16SIBELIUS/16SIBELIUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai