 in southern Baghdad.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/16/world/middleeast/sunni-lawmakers-to-boycott-iraqi-parliament-over-shiite-militias.html', 'snippet': 'Sunni political leaders have blamed the militias for the death of the tribal leader Sheikh Qasim Sweidan al-Janabi, who was abducted in southern Baghdad.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — After the abduction and murder of a Sunni tribal leader last week, Sunni lawmakers, in an effort to pressure the government of Prime Minister Haider al-Abadi to curb the growing influence of Shiite militias, said Sunday that they would boycott sessions of Parliament. The boycott of Parliament was supposed to last a week, lawmakers said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunni Lawmakers to Boycott Iraqi Parliament Over Shiite Militias', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sunni Lawmakers to Boycott Iraqi Parliament Over Shiite Militias', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abadi, Haider al-', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Janabi, Qasim Sweidan al-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sunni Muslims', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shiite Muslims', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-16T00:44:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c67a611-79a2-5975-92ea-2696b4053cae', 'word_count': 458, 'uri': 'nyt