brid in New York’s West Village. “The available means of discovery in New York has really been limited,” says the cofounder Kerrilynn Pamer, who teamed up with her friend Cindy DiPrima Morisse to launch the shopping platform last May. “There’s a health food store, a grocery store, and bits and pieces of different brands in different outlets — but if you wanted to take on a clean beauty routine, that experience of going to one place to smell perfume and try eye cream, all while feeling safe, has been missing.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16cap-cagney/16cap-cagney-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16cap-cagney/16cap-cagney-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16cap-cagney/16cap-cagney-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16cap-cagney/16cap-cagney-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16cap-cagney/16cap-cagney-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16cap-cagney/16cap-cagney-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16cap-cagney/16cap-cagn