c fit.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/02/16/deutsche-wohnen-offers-to-buy-austrian-real-estate-rival/', 'snippet': 'The firm, which is focused primarily on metropolitan areas in Germany, said the acquisition of Conwert Immobilien Invest would be a good strategic fit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – The German real estate company Deutsche Wohnen is planning a takeover bid for its Austrian rival Conwert Immobilien Invest that values the company at 1 billion euros, or about $1.1 billion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deutsche Wohnen Offers to Buy Austrian Real Estate Rival', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conwert Immobilien Invest SE', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deutsche Wohnen AG', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Austria', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-16T09:55:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/95e13dd8-6cdb-5365-a761-093505d19b6c', 'word_count': 410, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95e13dd8-6cdb-5365-a761-093505d19b6c'}, {'abstract': 'The members of Austin’s Mother Falcon are multi-instrumentalists, especially Tamir Kalifa, who is their man on accordion, piano, bouzouki, guitar and camera.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/16/recording-music-with-a-camera/', 'snippet': 'The members of Austin’s Mother Falcon are multi-instrumentalists, especially Tamir Kalifa, who is their man on accordion, piano, bouzouki, guitar and camera.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As with any scrappy aspiring rock band, when Mother Falcon goes on tour, its members endure the hardships of the road — sleeping in the van, hauling instruments, recouping after canceled shows, eating cheaply, quickly, and imprudently, and taming the tensions that flare up in close quarters among musicians. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Recording Music, With a Camera', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Musical Instruments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'South by Southwest Music and Media Conference', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CNN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'GoPro', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Public Radio', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Texas', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Austin (Tex)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-16T10:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt McCann', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McCann', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/995e944c-f3aa-5cfe-a4bb-5c15e1f6803d', 'word_count': 755, 'uri': 'nyt://article/995e944c-f3aa-5cfe-a4bb-5c15e1f6803d'}, {'abstract': '888 Holdin