s, including President Sukarno’s daughter Rachmawati, 15, staged an anti-American demonstration today\xa0 [Feb. 16] in Djakarta streets. The students paraded after attending a rally at the hall of the Communist-inspired Youth Front Organization, where they burned effigies personifying Americans and Prime Minister Tengku Abdul Rahman of Malaysia. The rally and demonstration were sponsored by the Communists. The demonstrators did not attempt to go near the U.S. embassy. —New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Feb. 17, 1965', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1965: Anti-U.S. Rally in Indonesia', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vietnam War', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jakarta (Indonesia)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-16T14:56:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50d03867-7ea1-59fe-a1ea-4c149959d585', 'word_count': 82, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50d03867-7ea1-59fe-a1ea-4c149959d585'}, {'abstract': 'A hospital’s quality is deeply influenced by its top management. But too often, hospital boards and C.E.O.s are focused on the wrong things.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/17/upshot/in-hospitals-board-rooms-are-as-important-as-operating-rooms.html', 'snippet': 'A hospital’s quality is deeply influenced by its top management. But too often, hospital boards and C.E.O.s are focused on the wrong things.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you or a loved one is having a heart attack, your most pressing concerns probably include how quickly you can get to the hospital and the quality of care you’ll receive. You’re probably not thinking about the hospital’s board room, even though quality of care for heart attacks and many other conditions may be determined in large part by decisions made there.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/upshot/17up-Health/17up-Health-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/17/upshot/17up-Health/17up-Health-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/upshot/17up-Health/17up-Health-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/upshot/17up-Health/17up-Health-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/upshot/17up-Health/17up-Health-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/17/upshot/17up-Health/17up-Health-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/upshot/17up-Health/17up-Health-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'le