cal project is the brainchild of the sometime fashion stylist Johanna Cranitch.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/16/white-prism-new-track-shake-you-off/', 'snippet': 'The musical project is the brainchild of the sometime fashion stylist Johanna Cranitch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s an undeniable visual quality to White Prism’s sound. The project features cool, breathy vocals that float above a bed of icy, angular synths and syncopated beats, simultaneously harkening back to ’80s dance pop and conjuring something strangely futuristic. “I really wanted to concentrate on marrying the two things that I love, which are fashion and music,” says White Prism’s lead singer and songwriter Johanna Cranitch, whose blunt bleached bob and shockingly blue eyes even seem suited to the music she makes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16symonds-prism/16symonds-prism-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16symonds-prism/16symonds-prism-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16symonds-prism/16symonds-prism-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16symonds-prism/16symonds-prism-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/16/t-magazine/16symonds-prism/16symonds-prism-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':