se is accompanied by gasps, because here we’re in the Blue Grotto of Capri. Act III is not set in any location so famous, but there’s something so picturesque about its bridge and pilgrim shrine that the audience applauds anyway.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/arts/17NAPOLI1/17NAPOLI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 238, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/17/arts/17NAPOLI1/17NAPOLI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 238}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/arts/17NAPOLI1/17NAPOLI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/arts/17NAPOLI1/17NAPOLI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 811, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/arts/17NAPOLI1/17NAPOLI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/17/arts/17NAPOLI1/17NAPOLI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/17/arts/17NAPOLI1/17NAPOLI1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Ballet Arizona’s ‘Napoli’ Embodies a Culture of Exuberance', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Mimes, Confetti and Gunfire, the Volatile Heart of Naples