cial Crisis, a Little Less Inequality', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leonhardt, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rose, Stephen J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-17T05:29:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Leonhardt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leonhardt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5326a0b6-8b2d-5254-9053-71bdc2cdf37a', 'word_count': 1184, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5326a0b6-8b2d-5254-9053-71bdc2cdf37a'}, {'abstract': 'The temporal mismatch between signing up for Obamacare and paying a penalty for not doing so may be hurting enrollment numbers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/17/upshot/enrollment-period-for-health-insurance-ends-now-the-tax-penalties-start.html', 'snippet': 'The temporal mismatch between signing up for Obamacare and paying a penalty for not doing so may be hurting enrollment numbers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Affordable Care Act’s second open enrollment period ended on Sunday. Well, almost. Some computer problems over the weekend have led the administration to give a one-week extension to people who tried and failed to sign up.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'capti