med like a good idea at the time. Adam Dean, a photographer working for The New York Times, and I had just returned from several back-to-back voyages in the South China Sea last November, reporting on the fishing industry and sleeping on cramped, roach- and rat-infested boats from Thailand and Indonesia. While waiting in Kota Kinabalu, Borneo, for our next boat to arrive, we had a couple of down days. So I suggested we try the Coral Explorer day package on offer from an adventure tours company called Intrepid Travel, based in Melbourne, Australia.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/travel/22BORNEO1SUB/22BORNEO1SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/22/travel/22BORNEO1SUB/22BORNEO1SUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/travel/22BORNEO1SUB/22BORNEO1SUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/travel/22BORNEO1SUB/22BORNEO1SUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/travel/22BORNEO1SUB/22BORNEO1SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/22/travel/22BORNEO1SUB/22BORNEO1SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u