33893b8-f0c1-5a61-a588-1cdb771ed740'}, {'abstract': 'Secondary sales of stakes in private equity, venture capital and real estate funds totaled $47 billion in 2014, roughly 80 percent more than in 2013, research by the investment bank Evercore found.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2015/02/18/a-boom-in-private-equitys-secondary-market/', 'snippet': 'Secondary sales of stakes in private equity, venture capital and real estate funds totaled $47 billion in 2014, roughly 80 percent more than in 2013, research by the investment bank Evercore found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Investors in private equity funds typically have to wait as long as a decade to get their money back. But many are now cashing out ahead of schedule by selling their investments into a secondary market, reflecting the buoyant state of private equity.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Boom in Private Equity’s Secondary Market', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Secondary Sales Jump', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-18T18:30:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e350ae8a-8182-5bf8-86cc-dc1dd85befe5', 'word_count': 454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e350ae8a-8182-5bf8-86cc-dc1dd85befe5'}, {'abstract': 'Rear Admiral John F. Kirby is the first casualty of a new defense secretary who has expressed reservations about having a uniformed officer serve as the Defense Department’s press secretary.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/19/us/john-kirby-pentagon-spokesman-will-be-replaced-with-a-civilian.html', 'snippet': 'Rear Admiral John F. Kirby is the first casualty of a new defense secretary who has expressed reservations about having a uniformed officer serve as the Defense Department’s press secretary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Rear Adm. John F. Kirby, the Pentagon press secretary and the public face of the American military for the past year, is stepping down, officials said Wednesday, the first casualty of a new defense secretary who has expressed reservations about having a uniformed officer represent the Defense Department in its daily dealings with the news media.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/us/19KIRBYWEB/19KIRBYWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/19/us/19KIRBYWEB/19KIRBYWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/us/19KIRBYWEB/19KIRBYWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/us/19KIRBYWEB/19KIRBYWEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1390, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/us/19KIRBYWEB/19KIRBYWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/19/us/19KIRBYWEB/19KIRBYWEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth':