e the width of your crust.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/19/garden/a-tool-for-modern-bakers-from-kmn-home.html', 'snippet': 'Aluminum rolling pins in three colors include an integrated ruler to measure the width of your crust.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While you may roam around your kitchen in search of a clean coffee cup, Kevin M. Vann and his colleagues at KMN Home in Traverse City, Mich., scan theirs looking for something to reinvent. An engineer turned product designer, Mr. Vann recently seized on the rolling pin, which he said was long due for an update. Experience had taught him that two features guarantee the success of any modern object: anodized aluminum and LEDs.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/garden/19CURRGOODS/19CURRGOODS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/19/garden/19CURRGOODS/19CURRGOODS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/garden/19CURRGOODS/19CURRGOODS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/garden/19CURRGOODS/19CURRGOODS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/garden/19CURRGOODS/19CURRGOODS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/19/garden/19CURRGOODS/19CURRGOODS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailw