abf-0b10abeccb27', 'word_count': 234, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87296f67-7506-5077-aabf-0b10abeccb27'}, {'abstract': 'Immigrants and their supporters gathered at rallies and news conferences in New York and across the nation to dispel rumors and to educate the immigrant population, as well as to buoy hope.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/19/nyregion/immigration-advocates-vow-to-continue-the-fight-after-obamas-plan-is-blocked.html', 'snippet': 'Immigrants and their supporters gathered at rallies and news conferences in New York and across the nation to dispel rumors and to educate the immigrant population, as well as to buoy hope.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Immigrants and their supporters gathered on Wednesday at rallies and news conferences in New York and across the nation to denounce a judge’s order halting President Obama’s sweeping executive actions on immigration and to vow a redoubled effort in support of the initiatives.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In New York, Immigrants’ Advocates Vow to Fight After Judge Halts Obama Programs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Immigrants’ Advocates Vow to Fight After Judge Halts Obama Programs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Semple, Kirk', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deferred Action for Childhood Arrivals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Orders and Memorandums', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-