paragraph': 'Reuben Cox started off in the documentary mode, photographing people from social groups and subcultures: marriages at City Hall, rural transgender women, bands and fans at the club CBGB, or players at a contract-bridge world championship. In this show, he turns the camera elsewhere or discards it entirely and uses changes in photography as a metaphor for his own move cross-country, from New York to Los Angeles, and the onset of middle age.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/arts/20REUBENCOXGALLERY4/20REUBENCOX-GALLERY4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/20/arts/20REUBENCOXGALLERY4/20REUBENCOX-GALLERY4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/arts/20REUBENCOXGALLERY4/20REUBENCOX-GALLERY4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/arts/20REUBENCOXGALLERY4/20REUBENCOX-GALLERY4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1392, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/arts/20REUBENCOXGALLERY4/20REUBENCOX-GALLERY4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/20/arts/20REUBENCOXGALLERY4/20REUBENCOX-GALLERY4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02