n warned health care workers that a superbug might be spreading because of diagnostic scopes that are difficult to sterilize.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/20/health/drug-resistant-germ-is-spreading-by-hospital-device-federal-officials-say.html', 'snippet': 'The Food and Drug Administration warned health care workers that a superbug might be spreading because of diagnostic scopes that are difficult to sterilize.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Federal officials warned health care providers across the country on Thursday that difficult-to-clean medical scopes inserted down the throat might be infecting patients with deadly drug-resistant bacteria.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/us/20superbug-01/20superbug-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/20/us/20superbug-01/20superbug-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/us/20superbug-01/20superbug-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 998, 'width': 998, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/us/20superbug-01/20superbug-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 998, 'width': 998, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/us/20superbug-01/20superbug-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/20/us/20superbug-01/20superbug-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh