e': '2015-02-19T23:09:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/22f32124-c2ab-5cd7-aa72-ec8a7c3efc34', 'word_count': 661, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22f32124-c2ab-5cd7-aa72-ec8a7c3efc34'}, {'abstract': 'Backstage at today’s fall/winter 2015 show, the hairstylist James Pecis was inspired by ’70s chic.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/19/new-york-fashion-week-fall-2015-j-mendel-hair-french-chignon/', 'snippet': 'Backstage at today’s fall/winter 2015 show, the hairstylist James Pecis was inspired by ’70s chic.', 'lead_paragraph': '“She is that French Vogue ’70s woman,” explained the hairstylist James Pecis backstage, of his beauty inspiration for J. Mendel’s fall/winter 2015 show. “Back then there was a reoccurrence of this type of look — all the girls were side parting and rolling their hair back.” So for today’s runway, he updated the classic chignon to complement the designer’s ultra-feminine collection. After parting the hair to the left, he divided it into several sections, saturating each one with Phyto Professional Wet Gel for a smooth, sleek texture. Pecis then used a blowdryer to add volume to the front of the hair before pulling it all into two ponytails, which he twisted together, pinning them up into a sleek, smooth variation on the elegant chignon. The effect: très magnifique.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/t-magazine/19SUBbeauty-mendel/19SUBbeauty-mendel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/19/t-magazine/19SUBbeauty-mendel/19SUBbeauty-mendel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/t-magazine/19SUBbeauty-mendel/19SUBbeauty-mendel-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/t-magazine/19SUBbeauty-mendel/19SUBbeauty-mendel-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/t-magazine/19SUBbeauty-mendel/19SUBbeauty-mendel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/19/t-magazine/19SUBbeauty-mendel/19SUBbeauty-mendel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/19/t-magazine/19SUBbeauty-mendel/19SUBbeauty-mendel-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Twist on a Very French Chignon for J. Mendel', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-19T23:15:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Renata Mosci', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Renata', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mosci', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_