as a national correspondent, and Mr. Farrow, the 27-year-old son of Mia Farrow and Woody Allen, will work on a series of prime time specials and interviews. The change is a strategy shift at MSNBC, which long has filled its schedule with left-leaning political commentary and now is moving toward straight news from 9 a.m. until 3 p.m. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'MSNBC Removes Two Hosts to Focus on Straight News', 'kicker': 'Business Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'MSNBC Removes Two Hosts to Focus on Straight News', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MSNBC', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-20T00:48:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Steel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Steel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba5f4de0-f709-5b95-b6b4-d1aabe2c1d7c', 'word_count': 134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba5f4de0-f709-5b95-b6b4-d1aabe2c1d7c'}, {'abstract': 'A critical guide to the visual arts in New York City and the area.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/20/arts/design/museum-gallery-listings-for-feb-20-26.html', 'snippet': 'A critical guide to the visual arts in New York City and the area.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Museums and galleries are in Manhattan unless otherwise noted. Full reviews of recent art shows: nytimes.com/art. A searchable guide to these and many other art shows is at nytimes.com/events. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Museum & Gallery Lis