 'nyt://article/e8eba7e5-ba4f-5b33-9065-358682808b32'}, {'abstract': 'Blacks weren’t the only victims of violence by white mobs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/20/opinion/when-americans-lynched-mexicans.html', 'snippet': 'Blacks weren’t the only victims of violence by white mobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE recent release of a landmark report on the history of lynching in the United States is a welcome contribution to the struggle over American collective memory. Few groups have suffered more systematic mistreatment, abuse and murder than African-Americans, the focus of the report. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/opinion/20carriganwebb/20carriganwebb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 307, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/20/opinion/20carriganwebb/20carriganwebb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 307}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/opinion/20carriganwebb/20carriganwebb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 523, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/opinion/20carriganwebb/20carriganwebb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1047, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/opinion/20carriganwebb/20carriganwebb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/20/opinion/20carriganwebb/20carriganwebb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank