re he died in 2010.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Emerging From a Father’s 7-Foot-6 Shadow', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Emerging From a 7-Foot-6 Shadow', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bol, Manute', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bol, Bol', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kansas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sudan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-20T12:30:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corban Goble', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Corban', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goble', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/37449f50-a223-523f-9002-c2c73394a03a', 'word_count': 1243, 'uri': 'nyt://article/37449f50-a223-523f-9002-c2c73394a03a'}, {'abstract': 'John Kerry’s State Department team is in transition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2015/02/20/high-profile-departure-leads-to-shake-up-of-kerrys-team/', 'snippet': 'John Kerry’s State Department team is in transition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The departure of Jen Psaki, the State Department spokeswoman, is only part of a larger transition for Secretary of State John Kerry and his team two years into his tenure.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/us/politics/20firstdraft-psaki/20firstdraft-psaki-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/20/us/politics/20fir