uld not be considered racist because the president was raised by “a white mother” — he has attracted an array of commentary from prominent figures in the worlds of sports, media, movies and, of course, politics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giuliani Comments Draw Tweets From Martina Navratilova, Judd Apatow and Others', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Giuliani, Rudolph W', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'APATOW, JUDD', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Navratilova, Martina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-20T13:44:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Damien Cave', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Damien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cave', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2dfd634f-7690-5ff4-99c7-4e4935764b81', 'word_count': 180, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2dfd634f-7690-5ff4-99c7-4e4935764b81'}, {'abstract': 'Metropolitan Diary: The sight of a woman trying to hack through two feet of plowed ice to get at her car in Brooklyn inspired two construction workers.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/20/a-helping-hand-and-a-forklift/', 'snippet': 'Metropolitan Diary: The sight of a woman trying to hack through two feet of plowed ice to get at her car in Brooklyn inspired two construction workers.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Dear Diary:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Helping Hand (and a Forklift)', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kick