: 1200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/497220fa-7a40-5566-9cc2-2f9854f6a4fa'}, {'abstract': 'We put together a ballot composed of all the prediction-market favorites. You can tweak it as you like.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/21/upshot/oscar-predictions-2015.html', 'snippet': 'We put together a ballot composed of all the prediction-market favorites. You can tweak it as you like.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We at The Upshot have entered our share of friendly Oscar pools over the years. We’ve done so even in years when we have not seen many of the nominated movies. If you find yourself in that position this year — or if you have seen a lot of movies but still aren’t sure how to fill out your ballot — we’re here to help.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/upshot/20up-oscarballot/20up-oscarballot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/20/upshot/20up-oscarballot/20up-oscarballot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/upshot/20up-oscarballot/20up-oscarballot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/upshot/20up-oscarballot/20up-oscarballot-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1998, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/upshot/20up-oscarballot/20up-oscarballot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/20/upshot/20up-oscar