ecline in Russia expertise and analysis, the report said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/21/world/europe/britain-europe-ukraine-house-of-lords-report.html', 'snippet': 'An analytical failure and a “glaring absence of political oversight” was compounded by a decline in Russia expertise and analysis, the report said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Britain and the European Union made a “catastrophic misreading” of Russia and President Vladimir V. Putin and “sleepwalked” into the Ukraine crisis, treating it as a trade issue rather than as a delicate foreign-policy challenge, British lawmakers said Friday in a scathing report. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Britain and Europe ‘Sleepwalked’ Into the Ukraine Crisis, Report Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain and Europe ‘Sleepwalked’ Into the Ukraine Crisis, Report Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erlanger, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Lords (Great Britain)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-20T15:37:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organ