ameis-winston-as-a-no-1-pick-is-not-without-risks.html', 'snippet': 'Before judging players strictly on how fast they run and how high they jump, the teams with the first five picks in the draft might take a look at these options.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.F.L.’s scouting combine moves to on-field drills Friday, and as with every other year, an event where no football is played will heavily influence draft decisions based on various measurements that may not translate to on-field success. The 40-yard dash in particular has a tendency to send some prospects soaring and others reeling. For every Kyle Boller who runs his way into being a first-round pick, there are players like NaVorro Bowman who see their stock tumble when their feet prove a bit slow.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/sports/COMBINE1/COMBINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/20/sports/COMBINE1/COMBINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/sports/COMBINE1/COMBINE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/sports/COMBINE1/COMBINE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1357, 'width': 2036, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/20/sports/COMBINE1/COMBINE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/20/sports/COMBINE1/COMBINE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75