ich Village, completed her fifth year in New York City on Friday. A new issue of “Rocket Girl” will be published in May.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From ‘Rocket Girl’ to Karaoke Superstar', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From ‘Rocket Girl’ to Karaoke Superstar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reeder, Amy (1980- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gustines, George Gene', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comic Books and Strips', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Image Comics Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-20T20:07:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Gene Gustines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': 'Gene', 'lastname': 'Gustines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d51282bc-af92-55dc-9402-6938b847e7dc', 'word_count': 766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d51282bc-af92-55dc-9402-6938b847e7dc'}, {'abstract': '“Leviathan” and “Ida” vie in an unusually tight competition for the foreign-language Oscar.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/20/category-close-up-a-tough-call-in-the-foreign-language-race/', 'snippet': '“Leviathan” and “Ida” vie in an unusually tight competition for the foreign-language Oscar.', 'lead_paragraph': ' For the first time in several years, the competition for the Oscar for best foreign-language film seems to be a toss-up. The last three winners (Iran’s “A Separation,” Austria’s “Amour” and Italy’s “The Great Beauty”) had victories that seemed pre-ordained, and even before that, it was easy to identify a front-runner. But this year looks like a real horse race between two movies from neighboring countries that are somber in tone but otherwise seem to have little in common.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Category Close-Up: A Tough Call in the Foreign-Language Race', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pawlikowski, Pawel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sissako, Abderrahmane', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zvyagintsev, Andrey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-20T20:08:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Rohter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a77ea845-31c5-5a48-bb91-7e78252e3784', 'word_count': 898, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a77ea845-31c5-5a48-bb91-7e78252e3784'}, {'abstract': 'This week’s properties include a condo in East Harlem and co-ops in Yorkville and Park Slope.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/02/22/realestate/20150222OTMNYC.html', 'snippet': 'This week’s properties include a condo in East Harlem and co-ops in Yorkville and Park Slope.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s properties include a condo in East Harlem and co-ops in Yorkville and Park Slope.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/realestate/20150222OTMNYC-slide-J1AT/20150222OTMNYC-slide-J1AT-articleLa