//www.nytimes.com/2015/02/21/arts/music/review-tovah-feldshuh-embraces-life-at-54-below.html', 'snippet': 'Tovah Feldshuh’s show at 54 Below, a mixture of character comedy and songs, urges us to have fun before it’s too late.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tovah Feldshuh, unlike most performers in their 60s, isn’t afraid to bare her arms. At Thursday’s opening-night performance of her spunky one-woman show, “Aging Is Optional,” at 54 Below, she stepped onto the stage wearing a shiny orange and purple outfit that might be described as an entertainer’s adaptation of a workout suit. Removing the jacket, she displayed her biceps, which are well-toned from her trapeze work in “Pippin.” By any standard, this woman appears almost alarmingly fit. Along the way, she mentioned that she is making plans to climb Mount Kilimanjaro.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/arts/21FELDSHUH/21FELDSHUH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 734, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/21/arts/21FELDSHUH/21FELDSHUH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 734}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/arts/21FELDSHUH/21FELDSHUH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 838, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/arts/21FELDSHUH/21FELDSHUH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1851, 'width': 1513, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/arts/21FELDSHUH/21FELDSHUH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard