, 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc2bb7aa-0296-5383-99a2-f7f23ad2af31', 'word_count': 667, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc2bb7aa-0296-5383-99a2-f7f23ad2af31'}, {'abstract': 'For today’s fashion show, the hairstylist Anthony Turner was inspired by dancing queens at the club.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/21/party-girl-hair-at-j-w-anderson/', 'snippet': 'For today’s fashion show, the hairstylist Anthony Turner was inspired by dancing queens at the club.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eastern European club girls were the high-energy beauty inspiration backstage for J.W. Anderson’s fall/winter 2015 runway. “It’s like this girl has been up all night dancing, and then goes to the nightclub bathroom to pull her hair back out of her eyes,” explained the hairstylist Anthony Turner of the unfinished feel. After saturating the hair with L’Oreal’s Infinitum mousse, he pulled it back into a chignon, twisting and scrunching it up into a bun. This haven’t-made-it-to-bed hair is aligned with the ’80s, good-taste-bad-taste mood of the show (and its banging techno sound track). Finally, he secured the bun with the kind of cheap, plastic comb that you’d discover in one of London’s discount pound stores. “It’s an antidote to the somber mood of last season,” explained Turner. “It’s not meant to look perfect — she’s having too much fun!”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/t-magazine/21backstage-anderson/21backstage-anderson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/21/t-magazine/21backstage-anderson/21backstage-anderson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/t-magazine/21backstage-anderson/21backstage-anderson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/t-magazine/21backstage-anderson/21backstage-anderson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/t-magazine/21backstage-anderson/21backstage-anderson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/21/t-magazine/21backstage-anderson/21backstage-anderson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/21/t-magazine/21backstage-anderson/21backstage-anderson-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Party Girl Hair at J.W. Anderson', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'London Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Anderson, Jonathan William (1984- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'J W Anderson (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-21T21:05:53+0000', 'document_type': 