25, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9346eab7-db33-5a73-a962-e385b0d83168'}, {'abstract': 'In addition to providing the more typical personal chef service, several businesses in the Westchester area also offer in-home cooking lessons and parties.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/22/nyregion/in-westchester-offering-cooking-lessons-at-home.html', 'snippet': 'In addition to providing the more typical personal chef service, several businesses in the Westchester area also offer in-home cooking lessons and parties.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chef Matt O’Connor displayed considerable finesse as he puréed broccoli florets and butternut squash at the home of Liza Wang in Irvington on a recent Friday night. But as the evening progressed, he discovered that a dazzling set of kitchen skills does not always guarantee the undivided attention of a roomful of amateur cooks. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/nyregion/22DINEWE1/22DINEWE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/22/nyregion/22DINEWE1/22DINEWE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/nyregion/22DINEWE1/22DINEWE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/nyregion/22DINEWE1/22DINEWE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/nyregion/22DINEWE1/22DINEWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width