rden and encountered all the security guards, elevator operators, ushers, team staff members, coaches, onetime teammates and reporters they used to see when they were Knicks players.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23KNICKS/23KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 569, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23KNICKS/23KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 569}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23KNICKS/23KNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 971, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23KNICKS/23KNICKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1943, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23KNICKS/23KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23KNICKS/23KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23KNICKS/23KNICKS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Smith and Shumpert Revel in Return to Garden as Cavs ', 'kicker': 'Cavaliers 101, Knicks 83', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Smith and Shumpert Revel in Return to Garden as Cavs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shumpert, Iman', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, J R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Cavaliers', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-22T21:11:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7fcc90f-1403-5c80-9ece-b4e8236e7c42', 'word_count': 809, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7fcc90f-1403-5c80-9ece-b4e8236e7c42'}, {'abstract': 'In a fall 2015 collection where texture and vibrancy loomed large, a low-key but look-at-me beauty moment fit the bill.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/22/mary-katrantzou-doll-eye-makeup-london-fashion-week-backstage-beauty/', 'snippet': 'In a fall 2015 collection where texture and vibrancy loomed large, a low-key but look-at-me beauty moment fit the bill.', 'lead_paragraph': '“A doll lash, but not a dolly look” is how the makeup artist Val Garland described the bold approach to beauty backstage at Mary Katrantzou’s fall/winter 2015 show. Borrowing tricks from the ’90s club kids, who would wear tiny dots beneath their eyes for dance floor drama, Garland followed the direct line of sight, drawing an oblong below the pupil with MAC’s Midnight Well eye shadow in black onyx. False lashes were then chopped into small, square sections and ironed (yes, actually ironed) flat before being layered onto the lower lashline just above the oblong for extra emphasis. The look was finished simply with a careful curl of the top lashes (for prettiness) and a generous dab of lip balm. In a collection where texture and vibrancy loomed large, this low-key but look-at-me beauty fit the bill.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/t-magazine/22beauty-katrantzou/22beauty-katrantzou-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/22/t-magazine/22beauty-katrantzou/22beauty-katrantzou-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/t-magazine/22beauty-katrantzou/22beauty-katrantzou-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/t-magazine/22beauty-katrantzou/22beauty-katrantzou-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1158, 'width': 868, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/t-magazine/22beauty-katrantzou/22beauty-katrantzou-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/22/t-magazine/22beauty-katrantzou/22beauty-katrantzou-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/22/t-magazine/22beauty-katrantzou/22beauty-katrantzou-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mary Katrantzou’s Doll-Inspired Eye Makeup', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kic