ackstretch.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/23/sports/autoracing/despite-wreck-jeff-gordon-is-smiling-after-his-final-500.html', 'snippet': 'Gordon led for 87 laps over all on Sunday in his last Daytona 500, but was scored in 33rd place after a crash on the backstretch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAYTONA BEACH, Fla. — Few drivers in motorsports have ever had the view that Jeff Gordon had Sunday at the start of the Daytona 500. Gordon was on the pole for his final 500, with nothing but track in front of him and a racecar capable of putting him in victory lane one last time in the final year of his career.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23GORDON/23GORDON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23GORDON/23GORDON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 567}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23GORDON/23GORDON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 968, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23GORDON/23GORDON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1698, 'width': 1796, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23GORDON/23GORDON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/23/sports/23GORDON/23GORDON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'ty