uri': 'nyt://article/e097c24e-5144-5bac-b7be-0506310c97dc'}, {'abstract': 'Iranian and American officials considered a proposal that would strictly limit for at least 10 years Tehran’s nuclear production but gradually ease restrictions in the final years of a deal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/24/world/middleeast/iran-nuclear-talks.html', 'snippet': 'Iranian and American officials considered a proposal that would strictly limit for at least 10 years Tehran’s nuclear production but gradually ease restrictions in the final years of a deal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — Iranian and American officials ended a round of high-level nuclear talks here on Monday considering a proposal that would strictly limit, for at least 10 years, Iran’s ability to produce nuclear material, but gradually ease restrictions on Tehran in the final years of any deal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/24/world/24DIPLO/24DIPLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/24/world/24DIPLO/24DIPLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/24/world/24DIPLO/24DIPLO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/24/world/24DIPLO/24DIPLO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/24/world/24DIPLO/24DIPLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cr