b-5d64-81ab-bef74d7c032e'}, {'abstract': 'There is relief among Valeant’s backers that the company has returned to signing deals, after its long chase of Allergan left it empty-handed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/24/business/dealbook/valeants-deal-for-salix-continues-frenzied-deal-making-in-drug-sector.html', 'snippet': 'There is relief among Valeant’s backers that the company has returned to signing deals, after its long chase of Allergan left it empty-handed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Valeant Pharmaceuticals, which has a penchant for deals, has taken on a $10 billion company in its latest deal to buy Salix. Valeant’s pledge last year to focus on organic growth and debt reduction didn’t last long. Cost cuts and tax savings from buying Salix Pharmaceuticals proved irresistible.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Valeant’s Deal for Salix Continues Frenzied Deal-Making in Drug Sector', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Salix Pharmaceuticals Ltd', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Valeant Pharmaceuticals International Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-23T19:37:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Cyran', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cyran', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8d1f591-9c43-5a91-8a61-6f7237e290cb', 'word_count': 391, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8d1f591-9c43-5a91-8a61-6f7237e290