d39c4f-3ca2-5eff-b8d0-8b8664364e2a'}, {'abstract': 'For fall 2015, British designers update the historic and opulent Italian fabric with dramatic shapes, bold hues and interesting lines.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/23/brocade-trend-london-fashion-week/', 'snippet': 'For fall 2015, British designers update the historic and opulent Italian fabric with dramatic shapes, bold hues and interesting lines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In London, opulence and regality have taken center stage at many a fall 2015 fashion show, from the historic venues in which they took place — the Tate Britain art gallery and the Victoria and Albert Museum —\xa0to certain decadent details in the collections. And over the past few days, beautiful brocade fabrics have been ushered into the 21st century with dramatic shapes (a voluptuous cape at Simone Rocha), bold hues (rich berry-and-black palettes at Mary Katrantzou) and interesting lines (sophisticated patchwork and cutouts at Erdem).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/t-magazine/23trend-brocade-gilchrist/23trend-brocade-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/23/t-magazine/23trend-brocade-gilchrist/23trend-brocade-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/t-magazine/23trend-brocade-gilchrist/23trend-brocade-gilchrist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/23/t-magazine/23trend-brocade-gilchrist/23trend-brocade-gilchrist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', '