t the behavior of children but of grown-ups.” Georges Delerue won an Oscar for best original score.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On TV Tuesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Tuesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-24T06:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d936565-9c10-5411-bb28-f288da46de34', 'word_count': 702, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d936565-9c10-5411-bb28-f288da46de34'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on February 24, 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/24/pageoneplus/corrections-february-24-2015.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on February 24, 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW YORK', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: February 24, 2015', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-24T07:13:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b604ab5c-ed6d-5ee0-a104-555c6ca68d20', 'word_count': 639, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b604ab5c-ed6d-5ee0-a104-555c6ca68d20'}, {'abstract': 'Christine C. Quinn, an adviser to Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, discusses his plan to require all