he Arab Spring uprising.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Cairo court on Tuesday acquitted former President Hosni Mubarak’s longtime interior minister of the last of several criminal charges that have kept him behind bars, opening a potential path to his release.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Court Clears Mubarak Official ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Court Clears Mubarak Official', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirkpatrick, David D', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adly, Habib el-', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-24T17:28:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By David D. Kirkpatrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/beb32813-ef13-5c32-910b-52b18f88a2c2', 'word_count': 224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/beb32813-ef13-5c32-910b-52b18f88a2c2'}, {'abstract': 'Two never-produced Pinter screenplays, “Victory” and “The Dreaming Child,” will be broadcast as radio plays on the BBC.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/24/film-scripts-by-harold-pinter-to-become-radio-plays/', 'snippet': 'Two never-produced Pinter screenplays, “Victory” and “The Dreaming Child,” will be broadcast as radio plays on the BBC.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Two film scripts by Harold Pinter, never made into movies, have been adapted as radio plays by the BBC’s Radio 4. The first, “Victory,” based on a novel by Joseph Conrad, will be broadcast on Saturday; “The Dreaming Child,” based on a short story by Karen Blixen, of “Out of Africa” fame, will be aired on March 7. (According to the BBC 4 website, most programs can be accessed from anywhere in the world.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/24artsbeat-pinter/24artsbeat-pinter-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/24artsbeat-pinter/24artsbeat-pinter-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/24artsbeat-pinter/24artsbeat-pinter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 587, 'width': 882, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/24artsbeat-pinter/24artsbeat-pinter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 587, 'width': 882, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/24artsbeat-pinter/24artsbeat-pinter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/24artsbeat-pinter/24artsbeat-pinter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/24artsbeat-pinter/24artsbeat-pinter-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Film Scripts by Harold Pinter to Become Radio Plays', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_head