utions for when your laptop battery begins to fade.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/26/technology/personaltech/filing-away-gmail-messages.html', 'snippet': 'Tips on how to archive Gmail messages to tidy up your inbox, and solutions for when your laptop battery begins to fade.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. If I archive a Gmail message in my browser, what does that do and where does the message go?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Filing Away Gmail Messages', 'kicker': 'Q&A', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Filing Messages in Gmail', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biersdorfer, J D', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Laptop Computers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gift Cards and Certificates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Mail', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'iTunes', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-24T19:35:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. D. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d4f67b9-8dbf-5d72-855e-16817e15df67', 'word_count': 619, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d4f67b9-8dbf-5d72-855e-16817e15df67'}, {'abstract': 'The restaurant Dirt Candy has more space a