w/f5516035-1553-57e1-b50b-628f5355ff82'}, {'abstract': 'The many highs of the six-week term that ends on March 1 have included performances of central classics by George Balanchine, along with rousing modern choreography.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/25/arts/dance/critics-notebook-new-york-city-ballet-wraps-up-a-memorable-winter-season.html', 'snippet': 'The many highs of the six-week term that ends on March 1 have included performances of central classics by George Balanchine, along with rousing modern choreography.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Balletomanes know how druglike their special brand of dance can be. Energy and beauty flow from the spectacle onstage; in the audience, perceptions of time, space and human potential feel profoundly changed. The need to follow performances becomes akin to addiction; and the end of a season brings withdrawal symptoms. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NYCB01/25NYCB01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 303, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NYCB01/25NYCB01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 303}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NYCB01/25NYCB01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 517, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NYCB01/25NYCB01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1034, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NYCB01/25NYCB01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 