o-be-sold-at-auction.html', 'snippet': 'The sample was collected in 1962 at Middlesex Hospital in London, where Churchill was being treated for a hip injury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Almost anything linked to Winston Churchill can be collectible, right down to the butts of his cigars. But it is hard to imagine an artifact rarer or more intimate than the one scheduled to be auctioned on March 12: a vial of his blood.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vial of Winston Churchill’s Blood to Be Sold at Auction', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Churchill, Winston Leonard Spencer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Memorabilia and Souvenirs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Middlesex Hospital', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-24T22:02:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kimiko de Freytas-Tamura', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kimiko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'de Freytas-Tamura', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b6f5ffe-28a4-5b39-9a7e-74bdd8c7b585', 'word_count': 440, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b6f5ffe-28a4-5b39-9a7e-74bdd8c7b585'}, {'abstract': 'A series of paintings by Leanne Shapton based on the book ‘The Nude: A Study in Ideal Form.’', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/03/08/t-magazine/08mens-document.html', 'snippet': 'A series of paintings by Leanne Shapton based on the book ‘The Nude: A Study in Ideal Form.’', 'lead_paragraph': 'A series of paintings by Le