our heart at the same time in his new cabaret show at 54 Below in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/25/arts/music/review-in-addicted-to-the-spotlight-mark-nadler-is-all-hot-wired-energy.html', 'snippet': 'The entertainer wants nothing less than to knock your socks off and break your heart at the same time in his new cabaret show at 54 Below in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mark Nadler’s new cabaret show, “Addicted to the Spotlight” at 54 Below, is a ferocious but good-natured retort to those critics (including this one) who complain that once he is on the stage, it is almost impossible to drag him off. He is a proud throwback to those voracious song-and-dance men from the vaudeville era whom you might have thought had gone the way of the dodo. But here he is. In their maniacal quest to shoot the moon, his closest equivalents are probably Liza Minnelli and Mandy Patinkin, who both also have sawdust in their blood. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NADLER/25NADLER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NADLER/25NADLER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NADLER/25NADLER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NADLER/25NADLER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NADLER/25NADLER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NADLER/25NADLER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/arts/25NADLER/25NADLER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘Addicted to the Spotlight,’ Mark Nadler Is All Hot-Wired Energy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Enduring Showman With a Fire From the Past', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadler, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-24T22:21:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a8eab15-5251-56f2-b926-8ecd310a6a99', 'word_count': 358, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a8eab15-5251-56f2-b926-8ecd310a6a99'}, {'abstract': 'In this caper by Lawrence Michael Levine, a young Brooklyn couple suspect the worst after a neighbor is found dead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/25/movies/review-wild-canaries-love-death-and-suspicious-minds.html', 'snippet': 'In this caper by Lawrence Michael Levine, a young Brooklyn couple suspect the worst after a neighbor is found dead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A bickering young couple suspect the worst when an elderly neighbor named Sylvia dies in Lawrence Michael Levine’s Brooklyn comedy, “Wild Canaries.” Setting this pa