a3-54ae-83df-01a1e4feeba3'}, {'abstract': 'When the company introduced the sweeter New Coke, it did not anticipate the “depth of feeling” for the original taste, Mr. Keough said in announcing a return to the regular formula.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/25/business/donald-r-keough-who-led-coca-cola-through-new-coke-debacle-dies-at-88.html', 'snippet': 'When the company introduced the sweeter New Coke, it did not anticipate the “depth of feeling” for the original taste, Mr. Keough said in announcing a return to the regular formula.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald R. Keough, who led Coca-Cola through the disastrous introduction of New Coke in 1985 and the return of the original formula just 10 weeks later, died on Tuesday in Atlanta, his family said. He was 88.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/business/25keough-obit/25keough-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/25/business/25keough-obit/25keough-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/business/25keough-obit/25keough-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/business/25keough-obit/25keough-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1306, 'width': 1959, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/business/25keough-obit/25keough-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': '