 neglected to stop a leak of radioactive water into the Pacific Ocean since last May.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/25/world/asia/japan-leak-is-disclosed-at-nuclear-plant.html', 'snippet': 'The operator of the ruined Fukushima Daiichi nuclear power plant said Tuesday that it had neglected to stop a leak of radioactive water into the Pacific Ocean since last May.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The operator of the ruined Fukushima Daiichi nuclear power plant said Tuesday that it had neglected to stop a leak of radioactive water into the Pacific Ocean since last May. The operator, Tokyo Electric Power Co., said it had first detected the flow of contaminated rainwater nine months ago, but did not explain why it had been so slow in responding. The company, known as Tepco, said it would place sandbags to block the leak of water, which it said was too small to change radiation levels in the plant’s man-made harbor. A triple meltdown occurred at the plant after a huge earthquake and tsunami four years ago. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Japan: Leak Is Disclosed at Nuclear Plant', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Japan: Leak Is Disclosed at Nuclear Plant', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fukushima Daiichi Nuclear Power Plant (Japan)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water Pollution', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pacific Ocean', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-25T02:57:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martin Fackler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martin', 'middlename': None, 'last