as discovered by the Office of Fiscal Analysis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Less than a week after unveiling his spending plan to lawmakers, Gov. Dannel P. Malloy of Connecticut learned that because of an accounting error, his budget had exceeded the state’s spending limit by $60 million.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '$60 Million Error Is Found in Connecticut Governor’s Budget Proposal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '$60 Million Error Is Found in Malloy’s Budget Proposal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hussey, Kristin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Malloy, Dannel P', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-25T03:35:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kristin Hussey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kristin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hussey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/adb7051b-906c-5be8-baec-22c833501359', 'word_count': 346, 'uri': 'nyt://article/adb7051b-906c-5be8-baec-22c833501359'}, {'abstract': 'Before a federal grand jury in Brooklyn, officers from the British agency MI5 told of watching Abid Naseer, a suspect in a bomb plot, as he rode buses, went to a mosque and visited an Internet cafe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/25/nyregion/in-disguises-spies-testify-of-watching-terror-suspect.html', 'snippet': 'Before a federal grand jury in Brooklyn, officers from the British agency MI5 told of watching Abid Naseer, a suspect in a bomb plot, as he rode buses, went to a mosque and visited an Internet cafe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal prosecutors presented the testimony of British intelligence officers as some of the most important evidence in the trial of Abid Naseer in Brooklyn, saying it was “essential” to proving the terrorism charges and insisting that the officers be allowed to wear disguises and that their faces be blurred by courtroom artists.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/nyregion/25TRIAL/25TRIAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 287, 'width': 203, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/nyregion/25TRIAL/25TRIAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 287, 'width': 203, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/nyregion/25TRIAL/25TRIAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/25/nyregion/25TRIAL/25TRIAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/nyregion/25TRIAL/25TRIAL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Disguises, Spies Testify of Watching Terror Suspect', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Disguises, Spies Testify of Watching Terror Suspect', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Naseer, Abid', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clifford, Stepha