Kluger (formerly of ABC Kitchen) and Jonathan Benno (Lincoln Ristorante), and pastry chefs handpicked by Christina Tosi (Momofuku Milk Bar), will serve dinner at the sold-out event, which will also feature a live auction put on by Christie’s. One participating chef, the James Beard Award-winner Michael Anthony of Gramercy Tavern (and, soon, Untitled at the Whitney), shared with T a recipe he’ll be serving tonight: spice-cured arctic char with black radish, dill and rye, from the Gramercy Tavern menu.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/t-magazine/25cookies-reese-1/25cookies-reese-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/25/t-magazine/25cookies-reese-1/25cookies-reese-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/t-magazine/25cookies-reese-1/25cookies-reese-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/t-magazine/25cookies-reese-1/25cookies-reese-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/t-magazine/25cookies-reese-1/25cookies-reese-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/25/t-magazine/25cookies-reese-1/25cookies-reese-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i