10348, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b1e50131-a06b-5b17-a51b-c7d01c61b8e6'}, {'abstract': 'If you want to fix Silicon Valley’s culture of sexism, venture-capital firms might be the best place to start.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/24/magazine/whats-really-at-stake-in-ellen-paos-kleiner-perkins-lawsuit.html', 'snippet': 'If you want to fix Silicon Valley’s culture of sexism, venture-capital firms might be the best place to start.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is telling that the highest-profile lawsuit of the moment in Silicon Valley isn’t about intellectual property or antitrust violations, but about sex discrimination. This week, a jury in San Francisco is hearing arguments in Ellen Pao’s suit against her former employer, Kleiner Perkins Caufield & Byers, one of the most prominent venture-capital firms in the tech industry. At the heart of the case is Pao’s claim that a married colleague at Kleiner Perkins pressured her into an affair and then, after she ended the relationship, retaliated by excluding her from meetings and email discussions, which affected her work performance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/24/magazine/24mag-kleinerperkins2/24mag-kleinerperkins2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/24/magazine/24mag-kleinerperkins2/24mag-kleinerperkins2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/24/magazine/24mag-kleinerperkins2/24mag-kleinerperkins2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/24/magazine/24mag-kleinerperkins2/24mag-kleinerperkins2-superJumbo.