alm-springs-modern-architecture-tours.html', 'snippet': 'Palm Springs has been marketing itself as a destination for fans of its slightly idealized past, playing up its modernist architecture and celebrity lifestyle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PALM SPRINGS, Calif. — They came for the walking tours of Vista Las Palmas, the neighborhood so popular with Frank Sinatra and his crowd that it is known as the Rat Pack Playground. They rode buses up steep hills to view the gemlike house built around a massive boulder by Albert Frey, an architect known as a father of desert modernism. And of course they could not miss the outdoor show of vintage travel-trailers and the nightly parties in private homes rarely open to the public.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/us/25MODERNweb4/25MODERNweb4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/25/us/25MODERNweb4/25MODERNweb4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/us/25MODERNweb4/25MODERNweb4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/us/25MODERNweb4/25MODERNweb4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/us/25MODERNweb4/25MODERNweb4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/25/us/25MODERNweb4/25MODERNweb4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/25/us/25MODERNweb4/25MODERNweb4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Mecca of Modernism, a New Pack of Devotees', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Mecca of Modernism, a New Pack of Devotees', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Patricia Leigh', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Palm Springs (Calif)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-25T16:30:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Leigh Brown', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': 'Leigh', 'lastname': 'Brown', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd585054-498f-5d59-9f46-70480943cdcd', 'word_count': 776, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd585054-498f-5d59-9f46-70480943cdcd'}, {'abstract': 'Ghanaians living within bunting distance of Yankee Stadium in the Bronx can have a taste of home with this dish.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/03/01/magazine/a-spicy-spinach-stew-from-ghana.html', 'snippet': 'Ghanaians living within bunting distance of Yankee Stadium in the Bronx can have a taste of home with this dish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I thought I would talk with Samuel Obeng about the smoky spinach stew the chefs serve at his Bronx restaurant, Papaye, but he steered the conversation toward weightier matters. “I want to set up an African cultural center here in t