ead of global banking, to help lead its core investment banking and trading units.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To fill the highly visible role of co-head of corporate banking, Deutsche Bank has poached a senior executive from one of its biggest rivals.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deutsche Bank Poaches Senior Banker From JPMorgan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deutsche Bank AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Urwin, Jeff', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-25T18:26:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dealbook', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bec2042a-3ed0-55e4-9950-192fb21bfb42', 'word_count': 238, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bec2042a-3ed0-55e4-9950-192fb21bfb42'}, {'abstract': 'A new tour in Myanmar and Thailand by Natural Habitat Adventures has an emphasis on parks and wilderness areas.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/25/a-myanmar-trip-with-nature-as-focus/', 'snippet': 'A new tour in Myanmar and Thailand by Natural Habitat Adventures has an emphasis on parks and wilderness areas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In what Natural Habitat Adventures says is the first nature-focused tour in Myanmar (formerly Burma), visitors will see a little-explored sid