-of-anesthesia-risks-to-young-children.html', 'snippet': 'Experts said that parents and their doctors should consider how urgently surgery is required for children younger than 3 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Faced with mounting evidence that general anesthesia may impair brain development in babies and young children, experts said Wednesday that more research is greatly needed and that when planning surgery for a child, parents and doctors should consider how urgently it is required, particularly in children younger than 3 years. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/science/26anesthesia/26anesthesia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 479, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/science/26anesthesia/26anesthesia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 479, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/science/26anesthesia/26anesthesia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/26/science/26anesthesia/26anesthesia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/science/26anesthesia/26anesthesia-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Researchers Warn on Anesthesia, Unsure of Risk to Children', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Researchers Call for More Study of Anesthesia’s Risks to Brains of Young Children', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grady, Denise', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anesthesia and Anesthetics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surgery and Surgeons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Journal of Medicine', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-25T22:01:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denise Grady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d06bd050-321b-512d-98aa-32ee49a8c03f', 'word_count': 1077, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d06bd050-321b-512d-98aa-32ee49a8c03f'}, {'abstract': 'The mobile app has become a popular platform for X-rated photos, videos and personalized shows, often sold on the sly to avoid violating rules.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/26/style/strippers-go-undercover-on-snapchat.html', 'snippet': 'The mobile app has become a popular platform for X-rated photos, videos and personalized shows, often sold on the sly to avoid violating rules.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Porn, it has been said, is a driver of technology.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/fashion/26DISRUPTIONS/26DISRUPTIONS-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/26/fashion/