 designers to create exclusive looks in a rainbow of hues. Stop by the second floor at 59th Street on Thursday at 6 p.m. to shop items like a Rebecca Taylor jacquard culotte jumpsuit ($450) and a Nanette Lepore shift with lace overlay ($450) — and to try out a photo booth that creates coloring pages in your outline. On Friday, the buy-one-give-one shoemaker TOMS is opening its first New York City shop. There you can enjoy treats from a coffee bar serving TOMS Roasting Co. coffee as well as One Girl Cookies. You’ll also find the brand’s full range of slip-ons as well as the new TOMS Handbags line, which includes an ikat duffel ($148) and cognac leather canvas backpack ($248); purchases help provide training and materials for safe births. At 264 Elizabeth Street.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/fashion/26SCOUT/26SCOUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/26/fashion/26SCOUT/26SCOUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/fashion/26SCOUT/26SCOUT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/fashion/26SCOUT/26SCOUT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/fashion/26SCOUT/26SCOUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/26/fashion/26SCOUT/26