7e730ba0a93', 'word_count': 997, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8139cc70-bb37-50ec-82b2-c7e730ba0a93'}, {'abstract': 'Questions about Capitol chicanery ran rampant in Albany on Wednesday after Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo held a cabinet meeting at the same time as Mayor Bill de Blasio’s budget presentation to state lawmakers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/26/nyregion/de-blasio-in-albany-to-discuss-budget-faces-competition-from-cuomo.html', 'snippet': 'Questions about Capitol chicanery ran rampant in Albany on Wednesday after Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo held a cabinet meeting at the same time as Mayor Bill de Blasio’s budget presentation to state lawmakers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — With 12 hours’ notice, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo convened an all-hands-on-deck cabinet meeting in the Capitol on Wednesday that focused on three issues: a previously announced plan to battle sexual assault on college campuses, a previously announced plan to expand prekindergarten, and a previously announced snowmobiling event. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/nyregion/MAYOR1/MAYOR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/26/nyregion/MAYOR1/MAYOR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/nyregion/MAYOR1/MAYOR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/nyregion/MAYOR1/MAYOR1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit'