amine sexual violence at colleges and the failure of schools to seek justice for victims.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/27/movies/review-the-hunting-ground-documentary-a-searing-look-at-campus-rape.html', 'snippet': 'The director Kirby Dick and the producer Amy Ziering examine sexual violence at colleges and the failure of schools to seek justice for victims.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Hunting Ground,” a documentary shocker about rape on American college campuses, goes right for the gut. A blunt instrument of a movie, it derives its power largely from the many young women and some men recounting on camera how they were raped at their schools and then subsequently denied justice by those same schools. Their stories — delivered in sorrow and rage, with misting eyes and squared jaws — make this imperfect movie a must-watch work of cine-activism, one that should be seen by anyone headed to college and by those already on campus. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘The Hunting Ground’ Documentary, a Searing Look at Campus Rape', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Searing Look at Campus Rape, and the Traumatic Quest for Justice', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dick, Kirby', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ziering, Amy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Hunting Ground (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-26T15:24:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'ori