 New York-themed covers on 15 series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Unlike the heroes of DC Comics, which often protect fictional cities like Gotham and Metropolis, the heroes of Marvel Comics tend to cluster around New York: Spider-Man, or rather Peter Parker, grew up in Queens, the Avengers and the Fantastic Four are headquartered in Manhattan, and the X-Men have a school for gifted youngsters in Westchester.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/arts/26artsbeat-hulk/26artsbeat-hulk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 910, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/26/arts/26artsbeat-hulk/26artsbeat-hulk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 910}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/arts/26artsbeat-hulk/26artsbeat-hulk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 675, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/arts/26artsbeat-hulk/26artsbeat-hulk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1350, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/arts/26artsbeat-hulk/26artsbeat-hulk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/26/arts/26artsbeat-hulk/26artsbeat-hulk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/26/arts/26artsbeat-hulk/26artsbeat-hulk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy'