i': 'nyt://article/21332051-bb23-5cef-8508-2e6e2bfe114a'}, {'abstract': 'A book tour of sorts for Shakespeare to mark the 400th anniversary of his death.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/26/shakespeares-first-folio-to-get-50-state-tour/', 'snippet': 'A book tour of sorts for Shakespeare to mark the 400th anniversary of his death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four hundred years after his death Shakespeare is getting a national book tour. The Folger Shakespeare Library throughout 2016 will be sending copies of the First Folio to libraries, museums and other places in all 50 states, Puerto Rico and the District of Columbia as part of its yearlong “Wonder of Will” initiative.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27ARTSBRIEF3/27ARTSBRIEF3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 357, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27ARTSBRIEF3/27ARTSBRIEF3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 357}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27ARTSBRIEF3/27ARTSBRIEF3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 609, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27ARTSBRIEF3/27ARTSBRIEF3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1218, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27ARTSBRIEF3/27ARTSBRIEF3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27ARTSBRIEF3/27ARTSBRIEF3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {