ran, Ernest Côté, who was tied up and robbed in his home in December, had died of natural causes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 101-year-old war veteran who was tied up and robbed in his Ottawa home in December, then left to suffocate with a plastic bag over his head, only to free himself and call the police, has died of natural causes, Canadian news outlets reported on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '101-Year-Old Veteran Who Survived Home Invasion Dies in Canada', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ottawa (Ontario)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, Ian (1955- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-27T00:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick J. Lyons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Lyons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe2246b2-4bf3-5dac-91ce-450e822b56f4', 'word_count': 87, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe2246b2-4bf3-5dac-91ce-450e822b56f4'}, {'abstract': 'Khaled al-Fawwaz was charged with publicizing calls to kill Americans in plots that eventually included the bombings in Tanzania and Kenya that killed 224 people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/27/nyregion/bin-laden-aide-convicted-of-conspiracy-in-1998-east-africa-bombings.html', 'snippet': 'Khaled al-Fawwaz was charged with publicizing calls to kill Americans in plots that eventually included the bombings in Tanzania and Kenya that killed 224 people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Saudi who was accused of being one of Osam