ew York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rebels Accuse Saudis of Fueling Unrest to Divide Yemen', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rebels Accuse Saudis of Inciting Unrest to Divide Yemen', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Almosawa, Shuaib', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houthis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hadi, Abdu Rabbu Mansour', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-27T01:11:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shuaib Almosawa and Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shuaib', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Almosawa', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97426af1-2230-51f2-825f-9812eeae2676', 'word_count': 585, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97426af1-2230-51f2-825f-9812eeae2676'}, {'abstract': 'Patrick Forbes’s film looks at doctors’ treatment recommendations after heart attacks, comparing the coronary calcium scan with the more expensive, more frequently used surgically implanted stent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/27/movies/review-the-widowmaker-a-heart-care-documentary.html', 'snippet': 'Patrick Forbes’s film looks at doctors’ treatment recommendations after heart attacks, comparing the coronary calcium scan with the more expensive, more frequently used surgically implanted stent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By now the average health care consumer perhaps understands that treatment recommendations from a doctor may be influenced by research grants, financial interests and other personal entanglements. “The Widowmaker,” a documentary by Patrick Forbes, takes a lengthy look at that phenomenon as it relates to heart attacks, promoting the coronary calcium scan, a noninvasive procedure that faced years of resistance because the medical establishment preferred the surgically implanted stent. The film’s only problem is that it may leave you so skeptical that you’re not sure you’re getting the unbiased story on the scan, either.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27WIDOWMAKER/27WIDOWMAKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 795, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27WIDOWMAKER/27WIDOWMAKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 795}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27WIDOWMAKER/27WIDOWMAKER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 774, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27WIDOWMAKER/27WIDOWMAKER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1547, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27WIDOWMAKER/27WIDOWMAKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27WIDOWMAKER/27WIDOWMAKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/arts/27WIDOWMAKER/27WIDOWMAKER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘The Widowmaker,’ a Heart Care Documentary', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Review: ‘The Widowmaker,’ a Heart Care Documentary', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Forbes, Patrick (Film Director)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Widowmaker (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heart', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-27T01:13:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Genzlinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Genzlinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/6946c840-234b-59d3-a074-7ce50dbdc959', 'word_count': 286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6946c840-234b-59d3-a074-7ce50dbdc959'}, {'abstract': 'Amazon has hired Mr. Carney as senior vice president for global corporate affairs. The move is unusual, as Amazon is known for grooming employees from within.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/27/technology/amazon-hires-jay-carney-former-obama-press-secretary.html', 'snippet': 'Amazon has hired Mr. Carney as senior vice president for global corporate affairs. The move is unusual, as Amazon is known for grooming employees from within.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amazon, a technology company obsessed with secrecy, is h