area over the past two weeks but did more than visit the Devils, the Islanders and the Rangers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/27/sports/hockey/some-new-york-sightseers-mix-plays-and-power-plays.html', 'snippet': 'The Coyotes, the Canucks and the Flames took up residency in the metropolitan area over the past two weeks but did more than visit the Devils, the Islanders and the Rangers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The athletic-looking group of men at “Jersey Boys” on Wednesday consisted of Arizona Coyotes players enjoying a day off. The 6-foot-2 Swede taking selfies in the N.H.L. store in Midtown was the Arizona defenseman Oliver Ekman-Larsson. Tables at Mr. Chow in TriBeCa and Del Frisco’s Grille near Rockefeller Center were recently filled by professional hockey players, some on their way to “The Book of Mormon.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/sports/ROADTRIP/ROADTRIP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 550, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/27/sports/ROADTRIP/ROADTRIP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 550}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/sports/ROADTRIP/ROADTRIP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 939, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/sports/ROADTRIP/ROADTRIP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1066, 'width': 1163, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/sports/ROADTRIP/ROADTRIP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStand