{'abstract': 'Mr. Kahn was a contrarian adherent who left Lehman Brothers in 1978 to open Kahn Brothers Group with two of his sons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/27/business/irving-kahn-oldest-active-wall-street-investor-dies-at-109.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Kahn was a contrarian adherent who left Lehman Brothers in 1978 to open Kahn Brothers Group with two of his sons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Irving Kahn, who made his first stock trade in June 1929 — turning a tidy profit from the stock market crash four months later — and persevered for more than eight decades to become Wall Street’s oldest living active professional investor, died on Tuesday at his home in Manhattan. He was 109.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/business/27kahn-obit/27kahn-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/02/27/business/27kahn-obit/27kahn-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/business/27kahn-obit/27kahn-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/business/27kahn-obit/27kahn-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1318, 'width': 1977, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/02/27/business/27kahn-obit/27kahn-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/02/27/business/27kahn-obit/27kahn-obit-thumbStand