funds are still attracting money from big investors. | K.K.R.-backed Samson Resources hires restructuring advisers.', 'lead_paragraph': ' HEDGE FUND SUES U.S. PROSECUTOR | More than four years and dozens of insider trading convictions after F.B.I. agents staged a surprise raid of three hedge funds ‒ feeding the national reputation of the prosecutor Preet Bharara as the new sheriff of Wall Street ‒ one of those funds is fighting back, Matthew Goldstein, Ben Protess and Andrew Ross Sorkin report in DealBook. On Thursday, David Ganek, a Manhattan socialite and art collector whose $4 billion Level Global was one of the funds raided, sued Mr. Bharara, the United States attorney in Manhattan, contending that official misconduct violated his constitutional rights.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Agenda: Hedge Fund Sues U.S. Prosecutor', 'kicker': 'News', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2015-02-27T12:23:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f397fe6-ea0c-5c5f-95ac-6b46702174df', 'word_count': 2087, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f397fe6-ea0c-5c5f-95ac-6b46702174df'}, {'abstract': 'In the madness of war, I saw that taking a life could be banal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/03/01/opinion/sunday/how-we-learned-to-kill.html', 'snippet': 'In the madness of war, I saw that taking a life could be banal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE voice on the other end of the radio said: “There are two people digging by the side of the road. Can we shoot them?” ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia