orshipful global following as Mr. Spock, the resolutely logical human-Vulcan first officer in the television and movie juggernaut “Star Trek.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/27/arts/television/leonard-nimoy-spock-of-star-trek-dies-at-83.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Nimoy won a worshipful global following as Mr. Spock, the resolutely logical human-Vulcan first officer in the television and movie juggernaut “Star Trek.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leonard Nimoy, the sonorous, gaunt-faced actor who won a worshipful global following as Mr. Spock, the resolutely logical human-alien first officer of the Starship Enterprise in the television and movie juggernaut “Star Trek,” died on Friday morning at his home in the Bel Air section of Los Angeles. He was 83.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leonard Nimoy, Spock of ‘Star Trek,’ Dies at 83', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leonard Nimoy, 83, Who Explored Worlds Beyond Spock, Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nimoy, Leonard', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Heffernan, Virginia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-27T17:10:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Virginia Heffernan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Virginia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heffernan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/07041adb-31c3-5f79-ab8e-817b349c6378', 'word_count': 1764, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07041adb-31c3-5f79-ab8e-817b349c6378'}, {'abstract': 'The irresistibly distinct, coldblooded and cerebral Mr. Spock was something new and long-lasting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/02/28/arts/television/for-leonard-nimoy-spocks-hold-made-reaching-escape-velocity-futile.html', 'snippet': 'The irresistibly distinct, coldblooded and cerebral Mr. Spock was something new and long-lasting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The title of Leonard Nimoy’s autobiography was “I Am Not Spock,” and that so offended some fans that he followed it with a second, “I Am Spock.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Leonard Nimoy, Spock’s Hold Made Reaching Escape Velocity Futile', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mr. Spock Had a Hold on Him, and Us', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nimoy, Leonard', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stanley, Alessandra', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Star Trek (TV Program)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-27T17:10:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alessandra Stanley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alessandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stanley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4aa5da0a-3484-5dbc-a91c-387ef3c9cc0e', 'word_count': 791, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4aa5da0a-3484-5dbc-a91c-387ef3c9cc0e'}, {'abstract': 'Leonard Nimoy, best known for playing the character Spock in the Star Trek television shows and films, died at 83.', 'web_url': 'https://