ations', 'value': 'Lloyds Banking Group Plc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Prudential Regulation Authority (Great Britain)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-27T19:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Hay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd4c8744-2465-5795-9ec6-513aacd96de8', 'word_count': 400, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd4c8744-2465-5795-9ec6-513aacd96de8'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Nimoy’s”Star Trek” co-stars took to social media on Friday to remember the man who was Mr. Spock.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2015/02/27/leonard-nimoy-is-remembered-by-a-constellation-from-star-trek-and-beyond/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Nimoy’s”Star Trek” co-stars took to social media on Friday to remember the man who was Mr. Spock.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Leonard Nimoy and his “Star Trek” co-stars have all had careers with many acts. In recent years, they’ve connected with avid Trekkies on social networks like Twitter and Facebook. And his colleagues and other admirers, including President Obama, took to those platforms on Friday to remember the man who was Mr. Spock.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leonard Nimoy Is Remembered by a Constellation From ‘Star Trek’ and Beyond', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nimoy, Leonard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shatner, William', 'rank': 3, 'major