ionaire Mikhail Fridman’s attempt to buy the energy subsidiary of the German utility RWE. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Britain, Wary of Sanctions, Adds Pressure to Keep Russian From Buying Energy Unit ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain, Wary of Sanctions, Adds Pressure to Keep Russian From Buying Energy Unit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reed, Stanley', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'RWE', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fridman, Mikhail', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LetterOne Holdings SA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BP Plc', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Browne, John', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'RWE Dea AG', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-28T20:55:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stanley Reed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stanley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/76830dcc-999f-5305-aa51-1d033f1345aa', 'word_count': 731, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76830dcc-999f-5305-aa51-1d033f1345aa'}, {'abstract': 'For seven weeks in spring, pitchers drill hard in the field, but once the regular season starts coaches, managers and players cite many reasons for not practicing the drills so frequently.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2015/03/01/sports/baseball/despite-october-errors-pitchers-fielding-drills-wither-after-spring.html', 'snippet': 'For seven weeks in spring, pitchers drill hard in the field, but once the regular season starts coaches, managers and players cite many reasons for not practicing the drills so frequently.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TAMPA, Fla. — It is a rite of spring, as much a part of the training camp atmosphere as the palm trees in Florida and the cactuses in Arizona. It is known colloquially as P.F.P., pitchers’ fielding practice, and it takes place almost daily on the back fields of the sprawling major league complexes.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/01/sports/DOG-01yankees1/DOG-01yankees1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/03/01/sports/DOG-01yankees1/DOG-01yankees1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/01/sports/DOG-01yankees1/DOG-01yankees1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/01/sports/DOG-01yankees1/DOG-01yankees1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/03/0