, were on their way home on Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CARACAS, Venezuela — Ratcheting up tensions with the United States, President Nicolás Maduro on Saturday ordered a sharp reduction in the number of diplomats at the American Embassy here, said Americans would now need visas to enter the country and took other measures to retaliate for sanctions imposed by Washington on Venezuelan officials.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Detained American Missionaries Leave Venezuela', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Venezuela Aims to Limit U.S. Diplomats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maduro, Nicolas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Missionaries', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2015-02-28T22:19:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Neuman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neuman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fba740fb-de3d-5cee-b327-b1cb5a23d250', 'word_count': 661, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fba740fb-de3d-5cee-b327-b1cb5a23d250'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the Milan Fashion Week photo diary of Valerio Mezzanotti.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2015/02/28/t-magazine/28scene-pucci.html', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Milan Fashion Week photo diary of Valerio Mezzanotti.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scenes from the Milan Fashion Week photo diary of V